   "title": "kernel forms file should hold only what the…",
   "body": "Original title: The kernel forms file should hold only what the emitter takes\n\nStep 5: Variable as @global/@local rules and Item into core/rules/ (reader), typing writes Call for a function-key Get (binding), reading helpers out of kernel/forms.wap (lead).\n\nbranch: wap-kernel-emitter-input (2026-11-20)\n\nMoved from warp's board 2026-11-20 (wap-repo-split).\n\nAdded by warp-lead with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=312604878\n\nleft (sweep 2026-11-21): typing writes Call for a function-key Get (warp-wap-binding, after wap-member-calls). Done: reading helpers out of kernel/forms.wap (b7df0fb); Item and Variable in kernel/surface.wap, accepted by warp-lead\n\ndone: reading helpers out of kernel/forms.wap b7df0fb; typing writes Call for a function-key Get 32d7d45 (warp-wap-binding)",
