  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-23T23:56:22Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhgdNdw",
   "title": "any value used as its own type",
   "body": "Original title: A value held in an any is used as its own type: shown, counted and read by key, and a block runs where code is wanted\n\nBranch any-values (pannous/wap). Red lines in test/wap/test_types.sh (an any holding a list shown/counted, a map entry read by key) and test/wap/test_functions.sh (twice { 4 } with a block or () -> int parameter). Fix: dispatchers test every list/map type boxed into an any for generic definitions, completed after typing (dispatch.wap, fits.wap, types.wap, data.wap); a code block given where every definition takes code is lowered as a function value (lowering.wap, shapes.wap, type_notation.wap).\n\nAdded by warp-wap-lang with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314164671\n\nOK 2026-11-22 via warp-interviewer: plan A for an any holding a list or a map (generic dispatch completed after typing, 40-60 core lines) and twice { 4 } (+20 lines); warp-reviewer: sound with work list, refused deeper nesting, library words — built in\n\nland: any-values eaf41c3\n\nOK 2026-11-22 via warp-interviewer: user decided any-values (a) lands, twice{4} included; +12 refusal dropped\n\nland: any-values eaf41c3\n\nland: any-values bf763ed\n\nfollow-up branch dispatch-rounds f3ba13f (warp-reviewer): boxed types once a round + DEBT on precompiled modules; +10 nodes, morning queue via warp-interviewer\n\nOK 2026-11-22 via warp-interviewer (night): the DEBT comment lands alone, 0 code\n\nland: dispatch-debt 0b097ff\n\nhandover: branch dispatch-rounds f3ba13f (boxed types once a round, +10 nodes, census 1930/1930, self 84 ✓); state: morning queue; next: on the user OK merge main, raise the ceiling by its measured nodes, hand off\n\nboard keeper 11-23: every land: tip (eaf41c3, bf763ed, 0b097ff) is on main; what is left is branch dispatch-rounds f3ba13f, waiting for the user's OK, and the card has no live owner: back to Next\n\nFrom lib/template.wap (wap-wiki-lib 2026-11-23): after x is map / x is list the value narrows to a bare map/list that has and x[key] refuse (no has takes (map, text)); an empty list literal {items: []} cannot be passed to a parameter typed any (α1 unknown). With wap-binding.\n\nbranch: any-values (2026-11-23)\n\nFixed in [10fb6b7f](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/10fb6b7f9f3ca17de71e69da14fa1c42969688bf): merge dispatch-debt: a DEBT note on dispatches_completed (comment only)",
