   "title": "rule matcher and lexer's tokens are each one class",
   "body": "Original title: The rule matcher and the lexer's tokens are each one class carrying every field: make them enums whose cases hold only their own fields.\n\nAdded by warp-wap-lang with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314206145\n\nmeasured 2026-11-22: Matcher as enum −2 nodes (7555→7553); with arm narrowing (+43 nodes) ≈ +16 overall: no shrink. WIP branch matcher-token-classes 875de10, not handed off; options (drop / arm narrowing alone / all) with warp-interviewer\n\ndropped 11-22 (user via warp-interviewer): no size win, arm narrowing not built (no new features today); branch matcher-token-classes 875de10 kept as a record\n\nClosed as obsolete: dropped by the user 11-22 (via warp-interviewer): no size win; branch matcher-token-classes 875de10 stays as a record (board keeper 11-23)",
