  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhhLlGg",
   "title": "program's compile warnings print only on first run",
   "body": "Original title: A wap program's compile warnings print only on its first run: the native wap reuses the cached compiled program and never shows them again. Body: driver.wap caches program-<hash>.cwasm in wap-seed/ and skips compiling; the hints (retyping, spaced map) are lost. Keep the warnings with the cached program and print them on every run.\n\nAdded by warp-wap-lang with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314207983\n\nOK 2026-11-22 via warp-interviewer: retyping warning drops the internal form (branch retype-message, separate from this card's cache fix)\n\ncorrection: the note above belongs to card retyping-warning, not here\n\nbranch: program-compile (2026-11-23)\n\nland: fix-program-compile 2144fa7 (extensions/native +18, 0 core; normal: hello + native + raise 47 ✓)\n\nUser 2026-11-23 via wap-interviewer: leave as is: hints print once, on the compiling run only. Branch fix-program-compile 2144fa7 (extensions/native +18) is not landed.\n\nReleased 2026-11-23 by wap-fixer: done: notes-file fix built and tested (native+raise 47 ✓); left: user 2026-11-23 keeps hints on the compiling run only, not landing; branch: fix-program-compile 2144fa7 (parked, pushed)\n\nClosed as obsolete: the user decided 2026-11-23 (via wap-interviewer): hints print once, on the compiling run only; branch fix-program-compile 2144fa7 stays parked, unlanded (board keeper 11-23)",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
