   "title": "one-letter text held by a name is not a text",
   "body": "Original title: A one-letter text held by a name written any is not a text to is\n\ntest/test_dynamic.wap:30 red since 83ef7d0. User 11-22: an any name takes the concrete type of its value; is accepts a type the value reads as (char reads as text). Branch any-char-is-text 9ff6fc1, +2 core.\n\nAdded by warp-wap-lang with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314460037\n\nuser OK 11-22 via warp-interviewer: +2 core (types.wap name_set_typed, conditions.wap type_test_typed); self 84 ✓, dynamic/types/texts/conditions 116 ✓\n\nland: any-char-is-text 9ff6fc1\n\nhandover: follow-up branch any-name-silent d2f6259 (a name written any retypes to any without the warning; +2 core, written_any list; 0-state variant needs binding to keep the written type, measured and declined); state: morning queue; next: on OK merge main, hand off\n\nFixed in [7666378](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/7666378d6f2aa807ad88b3b6a62aa53b5d5beb5f): merge any-char-is-text: a one-character text an any holds is a text (user OK 11-22)",
