   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhrppBg",
   "title": "function value has the type of its signature, so…",
   "body": "Original title: A function value has the type of its signature, so two lambdas of one signature are one type\n\nDebt analyze/function_values.wap:22. Shape: notes/open_decisions.md debt 1 (2026-11-22, wap-fixer). wap-reviewer: sound; the captures erase to one common supertype with a downcast inside the lambda; an overloaded name is picked by the expected type, two candidates without one are refused. Core +30 to +50 (about 10 back). Pays types.wap:28, calls.wap:334, types.wap:412, emit/function_values.wap:5.\n\nOK 2026-11-23 via wap-interviewer: user decided build it (core change approved for this shape).\n\nAdded by wap-interviewer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314854362\n\nbranch: signature-function-values (2026-11-23)\n\nland: signature-function-values cdecb7d (+877 nodes, ceiling raised; typing only)\n\n2026-11-23 size: cdecb7d measured core net +70 (code ~+53, comments +17) against the user's +30 to +50. wap-reviewer cuts sent to wap-binding: one conversion() case, one member-adding place, members_called via the call-through-signature path, plus the promised ~10 lines of removed fn<…> special cases (missing). Lands once core code is within +50; no new user question needed.\n\nland: signature-function-values 131ccd2 (trimmed: +35 net core, +688 nodes)\n\nFixed in [bbb91d3](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/bbb91d34bce0b4c5cefcfa50d0aa132585ad1ea0): merge signature-function-values: function values that meet are one value of their signature, settled by a call or a written function type; an overloaded name as a value picked by its function type (+35 net core lines, +688 nodes; OK 2026-11-23 user via wap-interviewer; careful path)",
