 "list-spread": {
  "id": "PVTI_lAHOAAfgFs4BsfrazhLFA64",
  "title": "Lists cannot spread another list into themselves…",
  "updated": "2026-11-23T09:59:25Z",
  "key": "list-spread",
  "agent": "",
  "try": "",
  "repeat": "",
  "now_by_todo": "2026-11-23T09:17:34Z",
  "assignees": [],
  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-23T09:59:25Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhsWY6g",
   "title": "Lists cannot spread another list into themselves…",
   "body": "Original title: Lists cannot spread another list into themselves with *xs or repeat with 3 times [1]\n\nBranch list-spread 3ca3e92 (wap-reader), sugar/data.wap two rules (prefix * as alias of the spread ..., a times b => times(a, b)), times() in types/lists.wap. spec: wiki/list.md. wap-reviewer: sound (an infix row would reserve times, which lib's hyperreal/complex use as a method; ... has no prefix reading; [a *b] is an edge case); perf nit sent to wap-reader (times copies the list n times).\n\nOK 2026-11-23 via wap-interviewer: sugar only, spec-backed, reviewer sound.\n\nAdded by wap-interviewer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314901422\n\n2026-11-23 revised (user to wap-reviewer: 3 times [1] is an edge case; general mechanisms must carry it): drop the rule $n times $xs and times() in types/lists.wap; the test becomes a program's own 'infix operator times(n: int, xs: list<int>) := (1 to n).flat_map(_ => xs)' checking 3 times [1] is [1, 1, 1] (test_operators, wiki/operator.md); wiki/list.md:253 loses '3 times [1] repeats ([x] * n is refused)'. *xs stays as the alias of ...xs. The earlier OK covers only that.\n\nFixed in [c8c60ea](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/c8c60eaaa29e014dbd9ba692018012e663fd2d79): merge spread-only: [0, *xs] spreads as ...xs does; 3 times [1] is a program's own infix operator (sugar/data.wap; spec: wiki/list.md; OK 2026-11-23 via wap-interviewer)",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
    "nodes": []
   },
   "parent": null,
   "subIssuesSummary": {
    "total": 0,
    "completed": 0
   },
   "type": "Issue"
  },
  "left_board": "2026-11-25"
 },
