   "body": "Original title: The native wap frees the compiler's memory once a program has run\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314912352\n\nOK 2026-11-23 via wap-supervisor, discussed with the user (popup: '(b) ok'): module_ran deletes its store after the run, extensions/native/run.wap + c.wap, +13/−4; 697 → 566 MB on a big program\n\nland: native-store-freed 8e894d3\n\nFixed in [051a766](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/051a7668289bff9704d62a002b64ecc9aadf7fdc): merge native-store-freed: a module's store is freed once its run ends, so the compiler's GC heap is gone before the program runs (697 → 566 MB on a 3 M-text program; extensions/native; OK 2026-11-23 user via wap-supervisor)",
