 "cron-tmpdir-fallback": {
  "id": "PVTI_lAHOAAfgFs4BsfrazhLFc68",
  "title": "wap run without a TMPDIR, as from cron, writes…",
  "updated": "2026-11-23T18:18:21Z",
  "key": "cron-tmpdir-fallback",
  "agent": "wap-fixer",
  "try": "",
  "repeat": "",
  "now_by_todo": "2026-11-23T16:33:33Z",
  "assignees": [
   "pannous"
  ],
  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-23T17:21:58Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhsyoNg",
   "title": "wap run without a TMPDIR, as from cron, writes…",
   "body": "Original title: wap run without a TMPDIR, as from cron, writes its temporary program to the root folder and fails\n\nwap/extensions/native/run.wap temporary_path(template) := getenv(\"TMPDIR\") + template: with TMPDIR unset (cron) a program's compile goes to /wap-XXXX.wap and fails with 'cannot read /wap-DKYfFx.wap' / 'write: cannot open /wap-….wasm'. Repro: env -i HOME=$HOME PATH=/Users/me/dev/bin:/usr/bin:/bin wap 'print \"x\"'. Fix in the driver: the user's temporary folder when TMPDIR is unset (confstr(_CS_DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR) on macOS, /tmp elsewhere). The coverage cron line passes TMPDIR meanwhile. Found by wap-fixer via scripts/coverage.sh.\n\nAdded by wap-fixer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314930095\n\nboard keeper 11-23 10:3x: the 10:26 coverage run (data/wap-tests/coverage.txt in the main checkout) still fails with 'write: cannot open /wap-XXXX.wasm' on many modules, so the TMPDIR workaround did not reach it; and its summary line reads 'lib modules 0/0, samples 5/0' while the file holds 121 lib ✗ lines and 299 sample ✗ lines (scripts/coverage.sh miscounts)\n\nbranch: cron-tmpdir-fallback (2026-11-23)\n\nbranch cron-tmpdir-fallback, tip 0d1e126 (fix baf7fab): TMPDIR else confstr user temp folder; test_native 40 ✓, test_hello ✓. Waits on the user's extension OK (asked wap-interviewer).\n\nuser OK via wap-interviewer (+15 in extensions/native); integrator asked to land. After landing and the installed wap's rebuild: drop TMPDIR from the coverage crontab line.\n\nUser OK 2026-11-23 (via wap-interviewer): +15 in wap/extensions/native, TMPDIR else confstr(_CS_DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR); land baf7fab.\n\nFixed in [bcd5a55](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/bcd5a55bf165638d980871fe4b6904519265367f): Merge commit 'f83d0ff' into HEAD\n\nlanded bcd5a55. Left: drop TMPDIR from the coverage crontab line once the integrator says the seed refresh put the fix into /Users/me/dev/bin/wap.\n\ndone: the installed wap carries the fix (seed wap-seed-2026-11-23-02d466ba); the coverage crontab line no longer sets TMPDIR",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
    "nodes": [
     {
      "login": "pannous"
     }
    ]
   },
   "parent": {
    "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhF4XjQ",
