   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhthNXg",
   "title": "Code naming it does not take it as its parameter",
   "body": "Original title: Code naming it does not take it as its parameter (square := it * it)\n\nBranch implicit-it 6eae0c6 (wap-reader). spec: wiki/block.md. core/rules/lowering.wap +16; sugar rule $xs where $condition => filter($xs, $condition) (in the approved shape); core/rules/stages.wap +1: a rule's where guard is a word, never a hole.\n\nOK 2026-11-23 via wap-interviewer: user decided build it (lead's e), and accepted the +1 stages.wap line separately.\n\nAdded by wap-interviewer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314974105\n\nFixed in [242af35](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/242af357a5a39d376cfe04b03d492e1076c140f6): merge implicit-it: code naming it takes it as its parameter, square := it * it, filter(xs, it > 1), xs where it > 1 (core/rules +17, sugar/data.wap; spec: wiki/function.md; OK 2026-11-23 user via wap-interviewer; careful path)\n\nuser via interviewer 2026-11-24: bug fix under the standing OK (≤3 net core lines + supervisor sound); `big := xs where it > 1` must not become a function.",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
    "nodes": []
