   "body": "Original title: Tests that check several things in one list become one check each\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314995178\n\nFrom the user's Todo in test/test_functions_calls.wap (# Todo split ALL tests that test multiple things in one list into smaller individual tests). Across test/: each item of a list check becomes its own check with its own description; nothing dropped, no expectation changed. The Todo lines become DONE (card split-list-checks, <commit>), text otherwise identical.\n\nbranch: split-list-checks (2026-11-23)\n\nland: split-list-checks d1ac136 (tests only: ✓ 571 → 812, no file fewer, no new ✗)\n\nFixed in [49433a7](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/49433a74769356505faeef4337bf88c7cb02ca2a): merge split-list-checks: every list check of separate cases is one check per case, each described by its own code (153 lines → 396, 571 → 812 ✓, no expectation changed; tests only, the user's Todo)",
