  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhuSZJQ",
   "title": "recursive function without written types gives no…",
   "body": "Original title: A recursive function without written types gives no value: gcd(48, 18) prints nothing\n\ngcd(a, b) := if b == 0 then a else gcd(b, a % b); gcd(48, 18) gives ø: the untyped instance's result is unknown while its recursive arm is typed, and the other arm's int is dropped. Shape: the result is the join of the arms that do not recurse; the recursive call takes it; refused when no arm gives one. Traced by wap-emitter, found by wap-fixer, queued by wap-lead.\n\nAdded by wap-binding with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315019506\n\nbranch: recursive-result (2026-11-23)\n\nland: recursive-result 61f3008\n\nOK 2026-11-23 via wap-interviewer: user decided land 61f3008 (core calls.wap second typing pass, fits.wap 1, types.wap; +95 nodes). n * fact(n - 1) without a written result stays refused with the fix-it.\n\nFixed in [dae7b2a](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/dae7b2ae79444fa3d2ccddd12b02143f4d7e0841): Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into HEAD",
