   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABh1J7Kg",
   "title": "wap's native host has no sound, midi, web view or…",
   "body": "Original title: wap's native host has no sound, midi, web view or clipboard: port warp's sound.warp and webview.warp\n\nUser 2026-11-23 (via wap-interviewer): copy all of warp's native host (/Users/me/dev/angles/warp/lib/host/native_host*, 3427 lines over SDL3/wgpu/CoreText/AudioToolbox/WKWebView) into wap, so wap has its own native host. Port it straight: copy warp's code and translate, don't redesign. The extension lines the port needs are pre-approved. Every run is headless (--no-window; until it lands, no run of a window, gpu or sound program at all). The port lives in wap's lib/host/native_host/, same file layout as warp's. A form wap can't read yet goes to wap-lead, never a workaround.\nThis card: native_host/sound.warp (356, AudioToolbox, midi) and webview.warp (358, WKWebView, clipboard, plus its .js files).\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315454434\n\n2026-11-23 wap-lead (from wap-emitter/review): bindings write wap's canonical C words: i32 i64 f32 f64 u32 bool handle text texts bytes out length owned_text ø; not warp's int/long/double/string/pointer, never float for a C float (f32). Struct by value: info: bytes<40> (not bytes40), coming in host-port-extensions step 2. Uncallable C functions no longer stop linking (c246e10). Compiler gaps → wap-lead.\n\nbranch: host-port-media (2026-11-23)\n\nPort shape (wap-lead, decided): plain wap over `from 'c'` — native_host files are used as source, a module's finished() runs at the run's end, no host_* words, no driver hook. run_options is parked (headless parked by the user).\n\nland: host-port-media 63ddbd3 (contains host-port-window). sound.wap, webview.wap ported; host words → plain library functions (wap-lead's shape); read_bytes, library_folder (driver, wap-emitter: sound), remove_prefix/suffix. normal path: test_hello ✓, compiler-growth ✓, files+native+text_words 56 ✓. Red until: resultless C callbacks (wap-binding), js_called_back/js_released (use js native port, parked), windowless/muted (parked).\n\nland: host-port-media ff1d0e2 (review fixes: loud C statuses, page load raises, library_folder in platform.wap raising; test_hello ✓, growth ✓, files/native/text_words ✓; test_c 3 ✗ not from this branch: sqlite prints an extra 0, a non-handle error check, qsort's c_callback crashes in core typing written_parameters (function-value-letters 83e3840 on main))\n\nland: host-port-media 0f540ce (reviewer sound; + comment-only nit)\n\ndup?: host-port-window (same, 2026-11-25)",
