  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABh440jA",
   "title": "A list of int32 or float32 fails to compile when…",
   "body": "Original title: A list of int32 or float32 fails to compile when it is shown\n\nshow(xs: list<T>) (types/lists.wap:163) calls show on each item; no show took int32/float32. From the gpu port (lib/splats.wap SplatFrame). Fix: show(n: int32), show(x: float32) in types/numbers.wap. Branch narrow-show 8376bdf4.\n\nAdded by wap-emitter with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315686743\n\nbranch: narrow-show (2026-11-23)\n\nland: narrow-show 8376bdf4 (patch /Volumes/Worktrees/wap-build/data/narrow-show.patch; test_hello ✓, growth ✓, primitive_page + numbers ✓)\n\ndefault_of (core/emit/wasm.wap) has no F32 branch: a float32 local would start as REF_NULL + F32, invalid wasm, and there is no f32_const. It can't be reached while `x: float32 = 1.5` is refused (gives float); when float32 values land, default_of needs a zero for F32 too (f32.const).",
