   "body": "Original title: The seed refresh stops because the warp host lacks the C function on_arm64\n\ntypes/c.wap c_struct called prim foreign c on_arm64, defined only in extensions/native/main.c; the types module's imports are all eager, so stage C on the warp host ran no hello. Fix: the check goes (ARM64-only noted in the DEBT). Branch seed-on-arm64 7c6601ef.\n\nAdded by wap-emitter with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315738917\n\nbranch: seed-on-arm64 (2026-11-23)\n\nland: seed-on-arm64 7c6601ef (test_hello ✓, c+native 60 ✓, refresh-seed --check stage C runs hello; patch /Volumes/Worktrees/wap-build/data/seed-on-arm64.patch)",
