  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhht9QQ",
   "title": "empty map m = {} should take keys of any type",
   "body": "Original title: An empty map always takes text keys, so m = {}; m[3] = 4 fails under wap; an empty list or map should take its element type from its first use. Body: lists already do (local, global, generic). Maps: one token in wap/core/analyze/data.wap:140, key fallback unknown_type(s) instead of text; branch map-key-inference, 315 tests green incl self. A value read before its first write (unicode_full) still needs a written type.\n\nAdded by warp-wap-lang with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314241674\n\nhandover: user 11-22: an untyped {} is map<any, any> (mixed keys and values), replacing map-key-inference. WIP branch untyped-map-any 1ede5b3 (merged any-values): data.wap 2 tokens, letters.wap bound_as 1 changed line (a letter bound to a type then to any is any), 4 compiler-source map types written; text keys work; still traps: a one-letter (char) key read or printed (any char equality, card any-char-equality). Next: after the any-char-equality decision, rebase on main, finish char keys, measure, morning queue; then strip lib/unicode.warp int-keyed map types. Branch map-key-inference (first-use rule) is superseded.\n\nnumber keys in a map literal: lib/cron.wap wants Field's same as {7: 0} (day of week 7 is 0); core/analyze/data.wap refuses 'a map's keys are words or texts', so it is {\"7\": 0} with get(text(v))\n\nbranch: empty-map (2026-11-24)\n\nland: empty-map 1380c9bc — an untyped {} is map<any, any>; reviewer sound (standing OK small fix, +1 net core); hello, maps_page, map_helpers, dynamic, json_class, records, data green; census size ceiling raised +50 (2ff0e7b8). Pending with interviewer: wiki/map.md line 51 text, test_data line 75 check name.\n\nlanded 1380c9bc (integrator)\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (wiki) via wap-interviewer: wiki/map.md line 51 new text as proposed by wap-binding; test_data check renamed to 'an empty map takes entries of any type'.",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
