   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhr9GGA",
   "title": "emitter should keep its primitives in one table",
   "body": "Original title: The emitter should keep its primitives in one table instead of seven\n\nBranch one-primitive-table: one primitive table, each operation a row of its kind, emitted by one match (review 2 item 2 step A). 2 commits unlanded, 2 days old.\n\nbranch: one-primitive-table (parked, found without a card by the board keeper 2026-11-23; tip e89094e)\n\nAdded by wap-board with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314874568\n\ndup?: emitter-primitives (same, 2026-11-23)\n\nboard keeper 11-23: the dup?: emitter-primitives above was a topic todo add made by mistake; dropped, no duplicate\n\nWIP handover (fleet restart): branch one-primitive-table-2 pushed, tip 3451ce87, worktree /Volumes/Worktrees/wap-build. test_hello green; careful path (run.sh, test_self, census) was mid-run at restart (logs data/opt-*.log in the worktree). Net +8 core: waits for the user's morning OK. Next: rerun careful path, hand to wap-integrator. Also mine: json-class (build on wap-binding's type-witness tip, ~+21 total, user OK needed via interviewer; old branch 9709b8f to delete after).\n\nState at restart: branch one-primitive-table-2 merged with origin/main and pushed, tip 0159d4f4, worktree /Volumes/Worktrees/wap-build. Careful path rerun was started (logs data/opt2-*.log there) and stops with this session: rerun it. Earlier run: test_self green, census red only on size 133494 (main's ceiling is now 134211), run.sh 125 failures, mostly *_wanted; to check against main: test_modules, test_numbers, test_collections, test_graphs, test_json_class, test_class_init, test_conditions_truthiness, test_signature_page, test_template, test_tasks. Net +8 core: waits for the user's OK, then hand to wap-integrator.\n\nCareful path on tip 0159d4f4 (logs /Volumes/Worktrees/wap-build/data/opt2-*.log): test_hello ✓, test_self ✓; census ✗ only on size: 134497 nodes > main's ceiling 134211 (+286, the branch must shrink or name its growth); run.sh 2095 ✓ 125 ✗, the same 125 files as before the merge, mostly *_wanted. Not wanted-files and red: test_class_init, test_collections, test_conditions_truthiness, test_graphs, test_json_class, test_numbers, test_signature_page, test_template, test_modules, test_tasks; not yet checked against main (test_modules is red in the integrator's batch too). Next: check those 10 on main, settle the size, then the user's OK for +8 core and hand to wap-integrator.\n\nwap-emitter 2026-11-24 night: careful path rerun on tip 26bf51c7 (main 638f143c merged): test_hello ✓, test_self ✓, run.sh 125 ✗ (all *_wanted, or on main's list already, or other cards: test_modules = module-alias-preload, test_tasks = ms unknown). Census ✗ on size only: 135604 > 135423, the branch adds 181 nodes (primitives.wap 2148 → 2312, emitter.wap +17): the table's closures cost more than the if-chain they replace. Not landable under the ratchet as is; morning decision: raise the ceiling for one mechanism (+181 nodes), or drop step A. Recommendation: drop it; the if-chain is smaller and already one function.\n\nOK 2026-11-24 night via wap-interviewer: drop step A (the table of closures) and keep the if-chain, which already sits in one function. Why: +181 nodes against the ceiling, and a smaller compiler beats a nicer dispatch. Branch one-primitive-table-2 26bf51c7 stays parked as evidence. Undo: land the branch and raise the ceiling by 181.\n\nReleased 2026-11-24 by wap-emitter: done: nothing landed; step A (one table) dropped by the night decision: +181 nodes for a nicer dispatch, the if-chain stays. left: nothing of step A; any later step of review 2 item 2 needs its own measured shrink. branch: one-primitive-table-2 26bf51c7 parked as evidence\n\nwap-lead 2026-11-24: already decided at night via wap-interviewer: step A dropped (+181 nodes), nothing to build; card can leave the board (no commit to close it with). Evidence branch one-primitive-table-2 26bf51c7.\n\nFixed in [e9c8d054](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/e9c8d0542a789db2f9b9aab7eaaaf63c7dd1f6f0): chore: open decisions: one-primitive-table night decision to present\n\nuser 2026-11-24 via wap-interviewer: keep the emitter's if-chain; branch one-primitive-table-2 is dropped (not landed).",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
    "nodes": []
   },
