   "title": "A module should export each word under its plain…",
   "body": "Original title: A module should export each word under its plain name\n\nBranch wap-export-dispatcher: a module exports its one function or the dispatcher of its overloads under the plain name; WIP trimmed, parked for the user's review (2 days).\n\nbranch: wap-export-dispatcher (parked, found without a card by the board keeper 2026-11-23; tip 9e00345)\n\nAdded by wap-board with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314875183\n\nparked: branch export-dispatcher b18b38a0 (+29 core). Two test_modules checks red: the text overload's char→text read imports types' text(c: char), so the module links the types module. Waiting on wap-emitter/wap-lead for a general char-read helper (option 1).\n\nbranch export-dispatcher ecc50415: called_export preloads the types module (test/wap/scripted.wap). The 2 'a host calls …' reds stay until c-out-of-preload lands (types module imports c::memmove). Then rebase onto main and hold the handoff for the user's core OK. The third modules red (module alias) belongs to card module-alias-preload.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: +29 core: plain-name export dispatcher per wiki/wasm-representation.md (tip b18b38a0, branch export-dispatcher); the no-types-module trap DEBT accepted. Land.\n\nland: export-dispatcher 233816df (origin/main merged, handed to wap-integrator)\n\nmerge 2c2d776f with main 53a9f09e (user OK 2026-11-24, +29 core). Careful checks running; then handoff to integrator.\n\nFixed in [f7543df2](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/f7543df2f210c4d819daaa57a01be606cb0c978a): merge export-dispatcher: a module exports each word under its plain name, its overloads as their dispatcher (user OK 2026-11-24, core +29)",
