   "body": "Branch wap-function-letter: a letter bound to a function type takes each function value that fits it, as a typed parameter does. Fix + size ceiling bump, unlanded 29 h.\n\nbranch: wap-function-letter (parked, found without a card by the board keeper 2026-11-23; tip 8967710)\n\nAdded by wap-board with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314875426\n\nmain already types it (checked 2026-11-24); test line on branch function-letter-test 5f512a55, handed to integrator; old branch wap-function-letter to delete\n\nFixed in [3063a120](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/3063a12093e57a9aeaecd814420bc38e209b31b5): merge function-letter-test: a lambda added to a list of a function type is called back (test)\n\nhandover (wap-lead retired): the lambda fix f6ef175a and its test acdd02ef are on main; asked of wap-binding but not confirmed: print a fn<key> type as plain 'function' (~1 line). Related branch of the lead: module-functions-on-call f315b01a, with wap-integrator (main's theory reds block its census remeasure). Supervisor takes over.\n\nReleased 2026-11-24 by wap-lead: done: lambda fix f6ef175a + test acdd02ef on main; left: fn<key> printed as 'function' asked of wap-binding, unconfirmed; branch: module-functions-on-call f315b01a with wap-integrator (next: land, re-measure census ceiling after theory-out-of-self-census, then remove worktree and branches)",
