   "body": "Original title: The warm state should carry the library already lowered, so each compile is faster\n\nBranch wap-warm-lowered: hello 0.17 s -> 0.12 s user; follow-up of compile-library-programs (wap#42, closed). Unlanded 28 h.\n\nbranch: wap-warm-lowered (parked, found without a card by the board keeper 2026-11-23; tip b413b06)\n\nAdded by wap-board with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314875964\n\nparked: branch wap-warm-lowered-2 tip ce3ea848 (pushed), census green, hello 0.165→0.14 s, core +2; waiting for the user's yes via wap-interviewer, then careful path and hand to wap-integrator\n\nparked at ce3ea848 (pushed, branch wap-warm-lowered-2); worktree removed to free the slot, recreate with cowtree from the branch on the user's yes\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: warm-lowered +2 pipeline.wap, ~16 extensions/warm.wap (ce3ea848). Land.\n\npaused (user order: dependent types). branch wap-warm-lowered-3 012be406 pushed: ce3ea848 merged with main (compiler.wap format line + language.wap fields resolved, both sides kept). Hello green; careful checks (areas modules/format, test_self, census) queued, then handoff to wap-integrator.\n\nFixed in [495dd2e5](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/495dd2e5582b3f8b8e16960ccac26d9855867df8): merge wap-warm-lowered: the warm state keeps each module's lowered blocks (user OK 2026-11-24, core +2)",
