  "column_since": "2026-11-24T07:23:55Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABh1-f2Q",
   "title": "wap's format writes hex numbers as decimal",
   "body": "Original title: wap's format writes hex numbers as decimal (0xFF00FF00 becomes 4278255360) and moves C declarations, so it can't be run on ported library files\n\nFound by wap-host-port-gpu on lib/host/native_host/gpu.wap. format must keep a number's spelling (hex, binary, underscores) and the order of C declarations; until then the landed lib files go unformatted. Reader/format owner; sibling of format-keeps-comments.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315505437\n\nbranch format-keeps-literals f5605f8: numbers keep their spelling (atoms.wap number_token, WRITTEN), texts show \\n and \\t escaped (types/texts.wap escaped); C declarations part dropped (host-port-gpu can't reproduce). hello, operators, interpolation, texts, self green; test_reader's 3 value-printing lines red, waiting for the decision via wap-lead to rewrite them as identity checks.\n\nbranch: format-keeps-literals (2026-11-24)\n\nwap-worker took over from wap-reader: merged main (776ea2c3); test_reader's 3 value-through-format lines rewritten as a format identity line + check() of values (c1e4ac80), green; careful checks running; review asked of wap-reviewer\n\nland: format-keeps-literals 45132d87 — handed to wap-integrator with patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/format-keeps-literals/format-keeps-literals.patch; careful checks green, census at 135151 (+79), wap-reviewer sound. next: todo done once landed\n\nFixed in [c538b3c2](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/c538b3c2f3567d765ea9b6742be715fb1e969c35): merge format-keeps-literals: format writes a number as the program wrote it (0xFF00FF00, 1_000, 1e3) and a text's line breaks and tabs as \\n and \\t; test_reader pins spellings by format, values by check (standing OK small fix atoms.wap +2, wap-reviewer sound)",
   "state": "CLOSED",
