 "as-narrows": {
  "id": "PVTI_lAHOAAfgFs4BsfrazhLP3SQ",
  "title": "Converting a value held as any to a class with as…",
  "updated": "2026-11-24T13:19:28Z",
  "key": "as-narrows",
  "agent": "wap-binding",
  "try": "",
  "repeat": "",
  "now_by_todo": "2026-11-24T12:58:02Z",
  "assignees": [
   "pannous"
  ],
  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-24T13:19:27Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABh3sGUg",
   "title": "Converting a value held as any to a class with as…",
   "body": "Original title: Converting a value held as any to a class with as fails: t as Tint says no Tint takes (Tint)\n\nsugar/types.wap:6 rewrites `$value as $type` to `$type($value)`. For an any or Node holding an instance, no T(x) takes it: `class Tint { c: int }; t: any = Tint(4); t as Tint` gives \"no Tint takes (Tint)\". It should fall back to the typed conversion (as_read in core/analyze/calls.wap) when no T(x) takes the value. Found by wap-binding and wap-reviewer on branch as-optional, where `as T?` now follows plain as.\n\nAdded by wap-binding with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315612452\n\nbranch: as-narrows (2026-11-24)\n\nbranch as-narrows tip 42006fd8: class rule writes identity $name(self: $name); probes t as Tint (Tint and any) pass; waiting wap-reviewer. json_class still red: run-time dispatch of an any holding a map to a class does not reach instance_from_map\n\nparked: identity overload collides with class Chain { next: Chain? } (Chain(c) returned c). Question to warp-interviewer: as fits first (core ~5 lines) vs per-class identity\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: reading A: x as T is x when x is a T, an any holding a T is narrowed (checked), otherwise T(x); ~5 core lines calls.wap + one sentence wiki/conversion.md §3 (text to approve). Build.\n\npaused for dependent types (user order 2026-11-24). Branch as-narrows-a 0e27a666 (/Volumes/Worktrees/as-narrows): the sugar 'as' narrows an any holding T to T, else T(x); if_typed folds tests known while typing. test_hello green; the probe and test_json_class green. One new red: test_conversion.wap:38 'hi() as int' (several results) reads as a call of each. Waiting on wap-interviewer: A drop that spelling for 't: int = hi()', or B narrow in core call typing (+15-20 lines).\n\nReleased 2026-11-24 by wap-binding: done: branch as-narrows-a 0e27a666, see note; left: interviewer decision A/B, then test + wiki conversion.md §3, handoff\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: B — hi() as int keeps working: call typing picks the overload whose result is T when as T follows (+15-20 core, calls.wap); conversion.md:156 and test_conversion.wap:38 stay.\n\nuser decision 2026-11-24 via wap-interviewer: B, when as T follows a call the call typing picks the overload whose result is T (+15-20 core, calls.wap); conversion.md:156 and test_conversion.wap:38 stay. Build after K1 (dependent types pause).\n\ntaken again by wap-binding 2026-11-24: worktree /Volumes/Worktrees/as-narrows, branch as-narrows-a merged with main (e84d7fa8); any-narrowing probe green; building B (hi() as int) next\n\nland: as-narrows-a 8cc00bd1 — careful path: hello ✓, area tests ✓ (2 reds not mine: conversion_wanted as! unbuilt, types:19 fixed on main), test_self ✓, census ✓ with the size ceiling raised to the measured 137674 (+213) in its own commit. Supersedes branch as-narrows (42006fd8). Patch: /Volumes/Worktrees/as-narrows/data/as-narrows-a.patch. Pending separately: the wiki/conversion.md §3 sentence, waiting for the interviewer.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (wiki) via wap-interviewer: conversion.md §3 NEW text approved: '`x as T` is the same call, written after the value, except that a value that is a T already stays itself: an `any` holding a T is that T, checked when the program runs.'\n\nwiki: conversion.md §3 sentence on wiki master 0197ad9 (user-approved via interviewer); handoff complete, branch as-narrows-a 8cc00bd1\n\nFixed in [67c56ece](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/67c56ece39127863dd1c9fe4456394e6733d56a2): merge as-narrows: x as T keeps a value already a T, an any holding a T is narrowed to it (checked at run time), and a word with several results gives the one as T, is T or a typed binding wants (user OK 2026-11-24, option B, core +12; spec: wiki/conversion.md)\n\nreverted on main 2405c796: value as int for a number refused ('this gives number, the name holds int'), so elaborate/read.wap:76 numeral(value as int) no longer compiles (wap-wiki-tidy). wiki/conversion.md: 2.7 as int → 2. Fix forward and re-hand.\n\nFixed in [ed841478](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/ed8414785d0446d2c63c8d896a92c6eaff985889): revert the revert: as-narrows comes back, with red-theory's fix on top",
   "state": "CLOSED",
