   "title": "for loop over a map cannot name both key and value",
   "body": "Original title: A for loop over a map cannot name both the key and the value: for key, value in scores.\n\nwiki/inventions.md 'Typed iteration' and test_maps_wanted.wap: for key, value in m walks the keys with each value. Plain sugar rule in wap/sugar/loops.wap. Branch map-pair-loop.\n\nAdded by wap-reader with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315743032\n\nbranch: map-pair-loop (2026-11-23)\n\nbranch map-pair-loop tip 018c3404 (worktree /Volumes/Worktrees/destructuring), pushed. Careful pre-merge green: 242 ✓ incl. self, growth ok; measured 133583 committed as bd546f05. Merged origin/main (ceiling conflict resolved to main's 134211). Next: on the merge run hello + inventions_page maps_page loops rules + census, raise SIZE_NODES to measured value in its own commit, patch to ~/Library/Logs/warp/wap-reader/, hand off; core +7 waits for user OK.\n\ntip b4af8ab8: merge checks green (hello inventions_page maps_page loops rules 80 ✓), growth OK, census green with ceiling 134477 measured. Patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/wap-reader/map-pair-loop.patch. Ready to land once the user OKs core +7 (stages, operators, keys) via wap-interviewer; then wap-reviewer.\n\ntip ad1794e9 (pushed): wap-reviewer's verdict built — the rule walks pairs($map), a library overload (map: keys with values; list: places from 1 with items). hello inventions_page maps_page loops rules green + a list check, growth OK, census green at ceiling 134544 measured. Patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/wap-reader/map-pair-loop.patch. Waits for the user's OK on core +7 (queued 10:00 by wap-interviewer).\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: core +7 (stages, operators, keys); the for-rule walks pairs(m). Land.\n\nFixed in [d2bc7396](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d2bc73969de27618acb82289453252cf33feb6ca): merge map-pair-loop: for key, value in scores walks a map's keys with their values, for i, x in xs a list's places from 1 with its items (wiki/inventions.md) (user OK 2026-11-24 via wap-interviewer)\n\nlanded as 70266c00 on main (rebased onto the user's note commit; the hash in 'fixed in' predates the rebase)",
