   "body": "Original title: x is y with a variable on the right should compare the two values, as wiki/equality.md says\n\nBranch origin/is-equal tip 3b44e172, +3 core in analyze/names.wap, held by wap-integrator for the user's core OK (queued for 10:00 in notes/open_decisions.md).\n\nAdded by wap-interviewer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315783652\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: core change as queued in open_decisions.md (tip 3b44e172). Land.\n\nFixed in [7ca384bf](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/7ca384bf898e588f17aa5988e9637b4be17003a7): merge is-equal: x is y with two variables compares their values (wiki/equality.md) (user OK 2026-11-24 via wap-interviewer)\n\nlanded as 19cf807b on main (rebased onto the user's note commit; the hash in 'fixed in' predates the rebase)",
