   "body": "Milestone K1 (plan 6.4): wap/extensions/theory/compute.wap: beta, zeta, delta, the step budget. spec: wiki/universe.md. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316280699\n\nbranch: theory-computing (2026-11-24)\n\nbranch theory-computing f9daa5b0: compute.wap (computed, computed_folded, unfolded) built on theory-terms b757ebd8; throwaway probe data/probe/compute_probe.wap 13/13 (beta over chains, zeta, delta at levels, opaque/axiom stuck, cache, gave up). Kept tests wait for the door (theory-explicit).\n\nland: theory-computing f9daa5b0 — after theory-terms lands (it is built on it); patch data/handoff in the worktree\n\nK4 computing: theory-structures-computing 01db5d1d (projection step, structure expansion for recursors, shared lookup), with the integrator after theory-structures; Supervisor's advisor review running.\n\nSupervisor review of 01db5d1d: NOT SOUND to land. compute.wap:92 case_standing reads facts.cases#1 for every stuck recursor (called from :69-70); a type with no cases (False) crashes: an ex-falso law dies with 'this list has no item at this place'. Fix: case_standing starts with: if not facts.k and structure_facts(c.environment, facts.of) is ø { return ø }; line 94 keeps only is_proposition. That also stops type_of+computed on every stuck nat/bool recursor. Add test lines: False.recursor law (expects \"\"); And.recursor[1] into int on an axiom, refused by value type; optional swap(swap(p)) law. Probes: supervisor scratchpad probe2.wap, probe3.wap.\n\nFixed: 0cb6dd0c (guard + False and And-into-int test lines) is sound; with the integrator.",
