   "title": "Number literals belong to the theory, and…",
   "body": "Original title: Number literals belong to the theory, and arithmetic on them is computed at once\n\nMilestone K3 (plan 6.7): the numbers declaration, the shortcuts licensed by theorems, unbounded numbers. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316282697\n\nbranch: theory-numbers (2026-11-24)\n\nbranch theory-numbers d65f4356 (pushed): lib/magnitude.wap split out of exact.wap (test_exact 13 ✓); Numeral(value: Magnitude) in terms.wap; numbers.wap with the seven shortcuts, shortcut_fired, opened (probe data/num.wap in the worktree, all 14 values right). Left: (1) hooks in environment/compute/equal, proposed to wap-emitter and wap-fixer; (2) the numbers declaration and its checks, which wait for typing.wap's declared and axioms_of and for K2's inductive declarations; (3) kept tests through the door.\n\nbranch theory-numbers 234fb1e6: numbers_declared and shortcut_declared written to the contract in notes/theory.md (numbers.wap). Hooks done: Environment.numbers, the shortcut firing in compute.wap's unfolded, the numeral opened in equal.wap, the Numeral arm of typing.wap. Probes are in data/k3. Left: the numeral line in iota once theory-recursors lands (land second, then add it); the door call agreed with wap-reader; kept tests through the door.\n\nland: theory-numbers 7170f76f (merged with origin/main; test_hello passes, compiler-growth ok, probes in data/k3 all right). The iota numeral line comes as a follow-up once theory-recursors lands.\n\nland: theory-numbers 0724bf8a (merges main ea50586a, the iota numeral line included; test_hello passes, growth ok). Replaces the 7170f76f handoff. Left after landing: the door's Statement case for numbers/shortcut (wap-reader or me, whoever lands second; show.wap is on main now, so that's me), then kept tests.\n\nland: theory-numbers 5ececd92 (merge of main with quotients; needs a seed refresh for lib/magnitude.wap). test_theory_numbers_wanted red until the door reads enum blocks.\n\nFixed in [d6286366](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d6286366efffaeb3d02469a44804c0510e37f204): merge theory-numbers: lib/magnitude.wap, unbounded whole numbers the kernel trusts, split out of exact.wap; theory number literals hold a Magnitude; quotients, numbers and shortcut one door statement (wap-coc-plan sound)\n\nland: theory-numbers d519cf1a (replaces 5ececd92): shortcut statements compared up to computing\n\nlanded: d519cf1a in d6fd9b5f (shortcut statements compared up to computing)",
