   "title": "prelude defines the computation types and effects",
   "body": "Original title: The prelude defines the computation types and the effects in the theory\n\nTrack L (plan 9.2): the opaque family of computation types with one member each, pure, bind, the effect sets in one canonical form, T or Error for Fail. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316284779\n\nbranch: theory-prelude-effects (2026-11-24)\n\nland: theory-prelude-effects 29f28d63 (patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/wap-reader/theory-prelude-effects.patch). Express path green (test_hello, compiler-growth). test_theory_prelude_effects is red only because check.wap doesn't compile on main (explicit.wap 238:33, card theory-out-of-self-census; test_theory_prelude_data is red the same way). Its 4 checks pass with a compiler that builds check.wap. Left out: the program's own events in the effect sets (the prelude has no texts yet); the 'refused by effect' acceptance belongs to E5 (the elaborator learns effects). Until then a proof about a computation's value is refused by the kernel (value type).\n\n29f28d63 audited by wap-supervisor: sound (no way out of Eff, no axiom). Fix forward: an outcome line for Error/Fallible; the prelude(name) helper is a 5th copy, goes to scripted.wap with wap-wiki-tidy's helper move.\n\nland: theory-prelude-effects 9f0bec15 (merged main with the as-narrows revert; test_theory_prelude_effects + _data green, 11 ✓)\n\nFixed in [62ce375f](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/62ce375f04f092ceb6572683cbeff34220c04d51): merge theory-prelude-effects: L4, the effects prelude (wap/extensions/theory/prelude/effects.wap) and its test",
