   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCWHgg",
   "title": "Enums, classes, match and recursion become terms…",
   "body": "Original title: Enums, classes, match and recursion as programs write them become terms of the theory\n\nMilestone E2: today's spelling makes inductive blocks; match to recursors; structural recursion; run bodies. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316285340\n\nbranch: theory-enums-match-recursion (2026-11-24)\n\nParts: blocks.wap wap-reader; match.wap + recursion.wap wap-emitter after theory-recursors.\n\nOwner now wap-emitter, all of E2 incl. elaborate/blocks.wap (wap-reader is not building it; old note stale). Builds on theory-law-axiom 1ac2ef4f (declare.wap). Supervisor allows a 3rd worktree while two handed-off branches wait on the integrator (rule bent: the landing queue, not the worker, holds the slots).\n\nSupervisor decision: the elaborator reads statements before lowering (as check.wap's statements_of), not lowered_program; no core change, parameterized enums included; at S3 the elaborator replaces lowering. blocks.wap reuses explicit.wap's enum reading.\n\nland: theory-enums-match-recursion c17bb97d — handed to wap-integrator; follow-up theory-below (Unit/Pair in the prelude, below per enum) for calls on a field of a field\n\nFixed in [80647de3](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/80647de32ec4de1e4ecf7340b87e3beb6391ba39): merge theory-enums-match-recursion: E2, enums and classes into inductive blocks, match into recursors, structural recursion into induction hypotheses (spec: wiki/enum.md; wap-supervisor's review points fixed)",
