  "column_since": "2026-11-24T14:26:32Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCWXCA",
   "title": "law with a proof is a theorem, wap verify needs…",
   "body": "Original title: A law with a proof is a theorem, and wap verify needs no Lean\n\nMilestone P1: Proved, Tested, FAILED, Assumed; axioms of. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316285595\n\nbranch: theory-laws (2026-11-24)\n\nplan (wap-wiki-tidy): 1) elaborate/file.wap holds the door's loop, door.wap and a new elaborate/verify.wap use it; 2) assume as a proof: the law declared as an axiom, recorded as assumed; 3) the elaborator door answers axioms of; 4) verify.wap prints one verdict per law/theorem/axiom after the program: Proved, Assumed (rests on an assume), Axiom, and for a law without proof Tested / FAILED, counterexample (the kernel computes the statement on small values of its parameters), Untested when no value can be tried; 5) wap verify <file> in the native commands runs it from the tree, as wap test does. Tests: test/wap/test_theory_verify.wap through the door; test_proof_wanted's wap-verify lines go green after a seed refresh.\n\n6086bdfe audited by wap-supervisor: soundness fine (Proved only after the kernel checks it; assume taints). Before landing: VERIFY_RUN resolved beside the binary (now relative to the current folder), help line lists all verdicts, test_variants_wanted off the branch. Decision: proved from a plain axiom stays Proved (axioms of lists it); only assume gives Assumed.\n\nland: theory-laws d965bb5f (handed to wap-integrator; wap verify with Proved/rests on/Assumed/Axiom/Tested/FAILED/Untested, assume, axioms of, native command via seed_part + WAP_TOOLS verify.wasm)\n\nd965bb5f diff-audit: fixes a-d done. Two small: driver.wap:71 argv[0] instead of shared exe lookup; wap-beside.sh:20 hides compile errors. Sound after those + merge origin/main (wap-supervisor).\n\nFixed in [a606bc60](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/a606bc602ac23949ca031c3201e8eb470c7cf9f7): merge theory-laws: laws are stated and checked, wap verify and --seed in the native host (wap-supervisor sound)",
