  "column_since": "2026-11-24T14:33:04Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCW8MQ",
   "title": "Traits, operators and conditions become terms of…",
   "body": "Original title: Traits, operators and conditions become terms of the theory\n\nMilestone E3: traits as structures with laws; instances from overloads; operators; decidable conditions; the number tower as conversions. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316286176\n\nbranch: theory-traits-conditions (2026-11-24)\n\nwap-supervisor: option A. The door loads the compiler's rules, reads If/Case, match via Case. One door option naming the wap tree, shared with elaborator-load (prelude), in its own commit first. Traits done at 8392c39d.\n\nland: theory-traits-conditions e22b6438 (handed to wap-integrator; traits, --tree, if/match through the tree's rules with the Decidable search)\n\nPre-existing gap (wap-binding): 'axiom f(a: int): int' gives 'wap does not lower this form yet' even without --tree. 3 == 3.0 dropped: theory has no floats (supervisor).\n\ne22b6438 diff-audit: Case/If sound. Back: Decidable and trait_of must refuse ambiguity (conditions.wap:44, instances.wap:24); holes_given copies declared_given; --tree done once by elaborator-load (wap-simplifier), E3 merges it and drops read.wap:276 fallback.\n\nland: theory-traits-conditions 497d7832; merged origin/main 399c1d13; theory areas green (numbers_wanted red is main's own wanted line 70d30a10); patch data/theory-traits-conditions.patch\n\nnext slice (wap-binding): operators. a + b is the call of the word +, == is the equality trait, #xs is a call (elaborate.md:157+); today 1 + 2, #xs and equal(1, 2) give unknown name at the door. E4 (wap-simplifier) waits on it, its lines in test_theory_subtypes_wanted.wap\n\nsupervisor review 497d7832: 4 fixes sound, hiding and the_only sound. Follow-ups: trait_of refuses before concrete fit (instances.wap:29); refusal tests don't check both names; no own-Decidable test; overload_elaborated read.wap:232 → the_only; holes_given instance_noted on trait binders (confirm). Then straight to the integrator.\n\nfrom E5 (a9cb3891): test_theory_statements_wanted spells Equal[1]/Equal.refl[1]; the elaborate door reads neither plain ('Equal[1] is no expression') nor with rules ('(Item Equal 1) is no expression'). E3's door must read Item too for those lines.\n\n0f587f0d: 5 follow-ups + Item (levelled(), 12 lines read.wap) done; supervisor sound (pre-granted), handed to the integrator. Kernel rechecks the elaborated levels.\n\nland: theory-traits-conditions 0f587f0d (supervisor: sound after the 5 follow-ups, plus Equal[1] levels read); replaces 497d7832; next slice: operators\n\nOperators slice: theory-sums reads If(T, yes, U) with T a type as the union T or U, in one named function in sums.wap (the supervisor agreed it is one reading, not a guess). That reading retires when or becomes a word of the prelude.\n\nland: theory-traits-conditions 9f761a28 (origin/main merged; theory areas green except the wanted statements file, now 8 of 9)\n\nFixed in [d0bb3f37](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d0bb3f37f7ae9af151f3dfb766e69f224ec21270): merge theory-traits-conditions: traits, instances and conditions in the theory, the door reading with the tree's rules (wap-supervisor sound)",
