  "column_since": "2026-11-24T17:20:07Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCXw-w",
   "title": "A recursion or a while that provably ends is…",
   "body": "Original title: A recursion or a while that provably ends is pure, any other has the effect Div\n\nMilestone E6 (plan 9.3). plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316287020\n\nbranch: theory-measures (2026-11-24)\n\nPhase 1 (approved by wap-supervisor): a nat parameter compared with a literal is read as a match through nat's course, so a literal step toward the guarded bound is structural; branch theory-measures. Phase 2 (Div, while, decreasing, a proof must be pure) waits on card theory-effects-typed (E5's effect typing).\n\nland: theory-measures 8f0a7d23 — phase 1 done, express green (test_hello, compiler-growth), theory areas 258 ✓ (reds only the _wanted files and test_theory_verify's by-line, unrelated). Patch: /Volumes/Worktrees/theory-measures/data/theory-measures.patch\n\nSupervisor audit 8f0a7d23: sound after fixes (sent). Required: the cases route only for recursion parameters (an exponential blow-up for plain ifs). Reuse instead_of, known_in and compute.wap's taken; check that < and <= give a bool; restore cases_deep. fact(2)=4 fix confirmed as the general course-arm substitution.\n\naudit point 6: recursion.wap recursive_call_elaborated now compares by equal(), which spends the equality budget and can give up (GAVE_UP); a call whose argument is equal to a field only after a long computation may be refused as non-terminating where it should be read. Not fixed on the branch; watch for it.\n\nSupervisor sound ca9b0ff6: the audit fixes are in (within_parameter guard, shared_by, replaced_by, arm state restored).\n\nFixed in [d0373dc1](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d0373dc1d0945583c71744a9cf95b0b6e88ce101): merge theory-measures: inside a recursion a choice takes apart what its condition waits on, so fact and fib by a guarded bound end, a course step reads its value where its arms wrote the parameter (phase 1; wap-supervisor sound)",
