  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCYDbw",
   "title": "Unions optional values are sums",
   "body": "Original title: Unions, optional values, any and class families are sums, and a call distributes over their cases\n\nMilestone E7 (plan 3.10). plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316287330\n\nbranch: theory-sums (2026-11-24)\n\nsupervisor 2026-11-24: plan OK A/A/A (or read from If(Type,yes,U) in one function, retires with theory-operators; binary prelude Sum normalised by the elaborator, 0 core; optional(T) := T or ø). Notes: order by the normalised term's key; distribution only after all declarations fail; two sum arguments distribute in turn.\n\nstep 1 at 6b92d6eb: A or B of types is the prelude Sum (logic.wap) in one normal form (flattened, computed, once, ordered by key, summed from the right); 4 lines in test_theory_elaborate. Next: injection into a union, T?, distribution.\n\norder: step 2 (injection) needs E4 made_of chain (converted ?? gone_down ?? refused, branch theory-subtypes): sums.wap injected() goes after converted. E4 waits on the E3 operators slice, so: E3 operators, E4 lands, then sums steps 2-4.\n\nSupervisor: step 2 dfdefab2 is sound. T? is optional(T) := T or ø over Sum. data.wap's enum optional goes; or_else and its laws are rewritten over Sum (avoids int or ø ≠ int?).\n\nSupervisor: step 3 7cca6327 is sound (optional = T or ø over Sum). Note: (A or B)? is not optional(A or B) in normal form; rare, fix by reassociation as a conversion when it bites.\n\nUnsourced, dropped from test_overloading_wanted: a local named like a method hides the method call: `positive(xs: list<int>): bool := { all = 3; xs.all(x => x > all - 3) }` refuses 'all: int is no function to call' (core/analyze, a method call resolving the receiver's word through local scope).\n\nSupervisor sound fa964109 (whole-branch audit, fixes in; fitting_declarations kept, since it has callers). If theory-subtypes-rest lands first, file.wap:48 becomes [operators, conversions, any].\n\nland: theory-sums a4491606\n\nFixed in [acff54b4](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/acff54b435de2f817274fd9dd4aa2af569257e70): merge theory-sums: sums in the theory, an overload keyed by its result where its parameter's key is taken (wap-supervisor sound)\n\nFixed in [12467e4f](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/12467e4f55776502acd136aa545bbbcd31789763): merge origin/main into theory-sums: theory-measures' choice by cases beside the union reading, recursor_facts beside several enums naming each other, a trial giving back both its answers and the arm state",
