   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCYT1g",
   "title": "A type may hold a sized list or a set of itself",
   "body": "Milestone E8 (plan 7): the elaborator lifts a condition out of a recursive type: the plain type, a predicate over the finished value, the subset type outside. Until then a refusal naming the fix. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316287585\n\nbranch: theory-conditions-lifted (2026-11-24)\n\nphase 1 (lists, vectors) done on branch theory-conditions-lifted a7685077: plain block, a bool by its recursor, the subset under the written name (elaborate/lifted.wap). Open gaps: (1) a list<Quad> where a list of the plain type is wanted is refused: conversions are not lifted through containers yet (plan 8), so a node of nodes needs convert(_, _, q) per item; (2) match on a value of a lifted type must take its value first. (3) sets and maps of a type itself wait for L5 (checked.wap not in the door's prelude). Wiki passage for wiki/subtype.md sent to the interviewer.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (wiki, 0 core, extension ~140) via wap-interviewer: the subtype.md passage 'A type may hold a subtype of itself' (Quad, Tree with vector(…, n)) is added as written.\n\nland: theory-conditions-lifted 3e04adb7\n\nSupervisor audit a7685077: shape sound. 7 fixes sent: unused yes_decided, carried and case_elaborated repeat existing code, a silent ?? [], an eager given text, tests lack accepted cases. Lands after the fixes and once the user approves the wiki passage.\n\nland: theory-conditions-lifted 2b40c40d (supersedes 3e04adb7: review fixes)\n\nFixed in [926a7510](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/926a751009905e1dd26a2c84675129ae09ce6d7c): merge theory-conditions-lifted: a recursive type may hold a sized list of itself (E8 phase 1; wap-supervisor sound, wiki passage user-approved)",
