   "body": "Original title: The compiler proves a law of a recursive function by induction along its recursion\n\nMilestone P4. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316288413\n\nbranch: theory-induction (2026-11-24)\n\nbranch theory-induction tip 766633cd: by_induction prover (recursor as a law, cases by the other provers), assumed laws as facts; 3 test lines green; sent to wap-supervisor for sound\n\nreview 766633cd: sound after fixes. Fix: (1) facts.wap:31-35 + rewriting.wap:57-60,112-120 repeat the kept/back_to attempt block applied_law centralises: one attempt helper; (3) test header names wiki/laws.md:34. Minor: facts.wap:28-29 skips hypotheses when computing proves but unify fails; commit type chore→feature on the merge message. Supervisor.\n\naudit fixes at 6b0bf2e5 (attempt helper, test source wiki/laws.md:34, wanted line for [f] join); to wap-supervisor, then integrator\n\n6b0bf2e5: sound (fixes in: attempt helper, header laws.md:34). Handed to wap-integrator. Supervisor.\n\nFixed in [2c38b2f7](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/2c38b2f7e91eb8fdd7f4fb93cb9516433f62bffc): merge theory-induction: laws proved by induction (wap-supervisor sound)",
