   "title": "new stages run beside today's typing and count…",
   "body": "Original title: The new stages run beside today's typing and count what the kernel accepts of wap's own source\n\nMilestone S1: the ratchet accepted n of N, with a compile-time gate. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316288679\n\nbranch: theory-census (2026-11-24)\n\nland: theory-census 3888aebc — floor 1331 of 11813, time 237 s vs typing 135 s (ratio gate 3), TRIAL_LIMIT 10000 net\n\nAudit 3888aebc (wap-supervisor): sound after fixes. 1 restore Theory state per refused statement; 2 ratio gate needs theory exit status; 3 count statements of unreadable programs; 4 per-program timeout or drop claim; 5 TRIAL_LIMIT conflicts with elaborate-overload-exponential trials_of, measure max trials in test_theory*; 6 reuse spellings_loaded/stopped_by. Minor: unknown option becomes a path.\n\nland: theory-census 242eb880 (careful path green: hello, growth, 13 theory/self areas 329 ✓ 0 ✗, ratchet all ✓: 1331 of 12153 accepted, 250 s vs 144 s, size 142815)\n\n242eb880: sound (wap-supervisor) once the census is opt-in (theory/prove landings + hourly). types copy() ok, ceiling 142815.\n\nland: theory-census c0bcae75 (theory census opt-in via ratchet_census.sh --theory; wap-supervisor sound)\n\nFixed in [ee1a022e](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/ee1a022ef35dac042db027b5567a75b6bb009474): merge theory-census: the theory census counts the statements the elaborator accepts, a floor and a time gate in ratchet_census.sh --theory, a statement refused after its trial limit (wap-supervisor sound)",
