   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiCajNw",
   "title": "An independent checker accepts what wap's kernel…",
   "body": "Original title: An independent checker accepts what wap's kernel accepts\n\nMilestone K7: the export and a checker of that format run over it. plan: notes/coc-plan.md (branch coc-plan until it lands); the files and what each gives the others: notes/theory.md.\n\nAdded by wap-coc-plan with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316289727\n\nbranch: theory-second-opinion (2026-11-24)\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (extension) via wap-interviewer: the second checker is our own, written in wap (a few hundred lines, separate from the kernel's files); no outside checker (nanoda_lib) is fetched.\n\nK7.1 export landed on branch theory-second-opinion 1c73db57: export(\"file\") (`export to` parses as a range). Next K7.2: wap/extensions/theory/second/ reads the export.\n\nK7.1-K7.4 done on branch theory-second-opinion tip c0135812 (pushed; patch /Volumes/Worktrees/theory-second-opinion/data/theory-second-opinion.patch), handed to wap-integrator. Checker: wap/extensions/theory/second/check.wap <export>. Test: test/wap/test_theory_second.wap (accepts the preludes, refuses a forged value). Gap: nested/mutual-with-indices blocks beyond the preludes are untested; recursors are derived from blocks as written. Found: formatter crashes ('this list has no item at this place') on second/*.wap and export.wap.\n\nland: theory-second-opinion c0135812\n\nK7 1c43681a soundness review: not sound yet. Independent in code; no false acceptance from door-written exports. Fix: (1) export hangs off one door; hang it off environment's added so the elaborator door exports too; (2) case name 0/\"\" lets recursor compute on a variable (expressions.wap:204, read.wap:96,99); (3) structure_named always ø (blocks.wap:232): proj/structure eta dead; (4) level-polymorphic recursor computing refused (blocks.wap:202/:86); (6) export.wap:86/:101 catch-alls drop/mislabel silently: refuse; (7) forged tests for non-positive field, Prop large elim, small universe, wrong shortcut, relabelled kind; plus mutual/indexed/poly-recursive/proj/divide in the accepted run; (8) print axioms and cross-check. Later card: nested types in second/ (blocks.wap:95). Minor: negative numParams, cites missing theory.md section.\n\nnot landing yet: c0135812 withdrawn, supervisor's review items 1-7 in work\n\nland: theory-second-opinion d36c09ef (K7 review points fixed; theory tests 92/92, hello, growth green)\n\nd36c09ef re-review: 6/7 fixes real, the accepted log misses no path. Must-fix: level param named \"\" reads as zero (second/read.wap:71-75, expressions.wap:9,98,102,111). Approved (supervisor) once that is fixed with a forgery line.\n\nland: theory-second-opinion c0876402 (supervisor-approved with the empty-name fix; 93/93 theory tests, hello, growth green)\n\nFixed in [0b72075e](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/0b72075e1df608a4597b863e5260541977211cc5): merge theory-second-opinion: K7, a second checker of the export that shares no function with the kernel (wap/extensions/theory/second/; spec: wiki/universe.md; wap-supervisor sound)",
