   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiDZy0A",
   "title": "Main is red since the theory files landed",
   "body": "Original title: Main is red since the theory files landed: the self test and the census try to build them\n\nReported by wap-lead. test_self and ratchet_census.sh walk every wap/*.wap: wap/extensions/theory/check.wap loads with 'this list has no item at this place'; theory/prelude/logic.wap fails ('Record: no definition takes these values' types'; true_decided/false_decided lines 52-53 unbound); the census stops there, no total. Decision (supervisor): until the switch (S3) test_self and the census cover the compiler only, wap/extensions/theory excluded (one shared exclusion, not one per script); theory is tested by test_theory. The two file errors go to their owners (check.wap wap-reader, logic.wap wap-wiki-tidy) if test_theory shows them too.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316353464\n\nbranch: theory-out-of-self-census (2026-11-24)\n\nFixed in [36a53c96](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/36a53c969173856cf4b7a764d8df54834aca9f32): test: test_self and the census walk the compiler's sources only, one shared list (compile.sh compiler_sources): wap/extensions/theory stays outside them until the switch (S3), test_theory covers it (wap-supervisor, card theory-out-of-self-census)",
