 "single-file-build": {
  "id": "PVTI_lAHOAAfgFs4BsfrazhLdNzM",
  "title": "wap can be built as one self-contained file",
  "updated": "2026-11-24T14:26:20Z",
  "key": "single-file-build",
  "agent": "wap-wiki-tidy",
  "try": "",
  "repeat": "",
  "now_by_todo": "2026-11-24T13:07:33Z",
  "assignees": [
   "pannous"
  ],
  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-24T14:26:20Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiFiLUw",
   "title": "wap can be built as one self-contained file",
   "body": "Original title: wap can be built as one self-contained file with all its modules inside\n\nUser 2026-11-24 chose: a build option. build.sh --standalone appends wap-seed's real parts (wap.wasm, the types module, the kernel, lib; ~3.8 MB) to the native binary, and wap reads them from its own file. The compiled-module cache (.cwasm, ~55 MB) moves to ~/Library/Caches/wap and is never bundled. The default build keeps the folder. 0 core lines, only wap/extensions/native. Follows theory-laws' fix to resolve VERIFY_RUN beside the binary; use one lookup for every part.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316487475\n\nbranch: single-file-build (2026-11-24)\n\nSeed parts via C23 #embed (codesign-safe), unpacked to ~/Library/Caches/wap/seed-<hash>/. Fully single file needs warp's wasmtime-capi staticlib (2 lines in warp): wap-wiki-tidy does it on warp branch single-file-wasmtime, integrator lands it (supervisor).\n\nland: single-file-build 5e39b8b2 (wap, contains theory-laws) + warp single-file-wasmtime 0c9aa77ef4 (staticlib). Standalone = #embed seed + force_load .a; red line 'needs no library but the system's' greens after warp's .a is installed.\n\nSeen on the way: when a module's import is missing, linking.wap module_path says 'wap: no module … as … names it' once per imported function (~60 identical lines for the types module); it should say it once per module.\n\nFixed in [786d31d5](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/786d31d5c1f842f0c57231acc494aee252ce4bec): merge single-file-build: build.sh --standalone builds one native wap carrying its seed parts and wasmtime (wap-supervisor approved)",
