   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiHYtig",
   "title": "proof theory understands operators on numbers and…",
   "body": "Original title: The proof theory understands + - * and the other operators on numbers and lists\n\nTopic dependent-types. The theory prelude declares its operators by spelling (prelude/operators.wap), and adds the refusal 'no fitting overload'. Under 30 lines, no core. Owner wap-binding.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316608544\n\nbranch: theory-operators (2026-11-24)\n\nsupervisor: audit of 16dc0dd0: design sound; 3 fixes sent (nested refusal swallowed at read.wap:264, refusal tests, list.item arity at test line 107). Code is ~38 lines, not <30.\n\nland: theory-operators-b e5ecd795 (supersedes theory-operators 16dc0dd0): operators in prelude/operators.wap; no fitting overload names each candidate's reason; 7 new lines green; reds only main's 4 (dot-word-braceless-call)\n\nsupervisor: e5ecd795 (branch theory-operators-b) sound: a nested no-fit legitimately rules a candidate out (else order-dependent), now every candidate's own refusal is named; 3 refusal tests. Sent to integrator.\n\nfrom wap-emitter: test_theory_statements_wanted still has 's#1: nat = n' accepted where a refusal is wanted (binding's line).\n\nland: theory-operators-b 67181e6d (merged origin/main with theory-subtypes; supersedes e5ecd795)\n\nFixed in [ab39067a](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/ab39067a3f9a1bfa3df4533d120af110ae62165c): merge theory-operators: the prelude's operators read as the elaborator's, a failed overload naming each candidate's reason (wap-supervisor sound)",
