  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-24T18:53:46Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiJj-rA",
   "title": "Proofs don't track effects yet: no Pure, no Div",
   "body": "Original title: Proofs don't track effects yet: no Pure, no Div, so a proof may loop or print\n\nE5 phase 2. theory-statements-effects is closed (2cf9f22f), but the elaborator in wap/extensions/theory/elaborate has no computation types, no 'effects of' and no '! Pure'. Only prelude/effects.wap declares them. Needed before E6 phase 2 (theory-measures): a refused recursion becomes an opaque T ! Div that still runs, a while with no measure is Div, 'decreasing m' adds a measure with the decrease as a prover obligation, and a law's proof must be pure. Found by wap-fixer. Design: notes/coc-plan.md E5/E6.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316755440\n\nbranch: theory-effects-typed (2026-11-24)\n\nSupervisor: shape approved (extensions/theory/elaborate only; phase 1 types+reports, phase 2 bind of computations as second tip; Div opaque keeps the written name).\n\nphase 1 tip 92e82393 on origin/theory-effects-typed (E5: computation types, effects of, ! Pure, Div opaque, a proof must be pure); phase 2 (bind lifting, ~45 lines) waits for the supervisor's go\n\nSupervisor audit phase 1 92e82393: sound after fixes (no False route). Fix: keep run body; join nested effect sets; typed refusal instead of message prefix; Div via Effects case not literal; law refusal names chain; laws about Div values stay Tested; two copies.\n\nUser decision 2026-11-24 (via interviewer): a function with no result is impure; its calls are never folded, memoized or dropped; `! Pure` on one is refused naming why. Needs wiki/effects.md + wiki/pure.md passage (text to interviewer before landing) and a test line. Folded into this card (theory-statements-effects is Done, wap-emitter retired).\n\nuser 2026-11-24 (wiki) via wap-interviewer: a function that returns nothing is impure: never folded, memoized or dropped; ! Pure on it is refused. Wiki text to wap-interviewer before landing.\n\nuser 2026-11-24 (wiki) via wap-interviewer: drop the ! Pure keyword (from warp's wiki, older than the plan). Purity is inferred only; a proof or --strict refuses an impure function by inference. Remove it from the wiki pages, coc-plan E5/E6/3.9 and test_effects_wanted.wap lines 13-14 (removal granted). Wiki text to the interviewer before landing.\n\nUser decision 2026-11-24 (via interviewer): drop `! Pure`; purity inferred, never declared. Wiki pages listed in interviewer msg; coc-plan E5/E6/3.9 reworded; test_effects_wanted.wap 13-14 removal granted (own commit). `! IO, FFI` stays. No-result rule: impure, proof refuses it.\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-24: wiki cec4a52 approved as the wording of the user's decisions (drop ! Pure, no-result impure, effects inferred, ! only limits, FFI from use/import). effects of keeps printing Pure.\n\nland: theory-effects-typed bc0c5f62 (phases 1+2 + audit; wiki branch theory-effects-typed cec4a52, interviewer approved)\n\nSupervisor grants test edits 4b6f727c (levels after Sort(u)) and 6acbbb5b (refusal lines → Div per plan 9.3; tests never pin refusals). Wiki cec4a52 needs interviewer wording OK.\n\nSupervisor audit bc0c5f62: sound after fixes (no False). Must fix: for-round body not closed (computation lifted out of loop); alias T := nat ! IO lets a law through (unfold before statement_pure); probe zero-param unit; pending cleared on diverging path; keep '+' wanted line.\n\nland: theory-effects-typed 64ae63c6 (+ wiki cec4a52)\n\nSupervisor audit 64ae63c6: sound after fixes — let scope regression statements.wap:63 (restore rest_read, probe k(n) := {m=3; add(m, away(m))}), gives_nothing comment vs x: Unit := Unit.unit, is_function_type/is_sort shape dup.\n\nSupervisor: d3326797 sound (let rest closes inside via rest_read; k(n) Div test line).\n\nland: theory-effects-typed d3326797 (+ wiki cec4a52); supervisor sound\n\nFixed in [ac959757](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/ac95975736846180f1aff3d506e707c9a36f711c): merge theory-effects-typed: the elaborator types effects, purity inferred and `! Pure` gone (E5 phases 1-2; user decisions 2026-11-24 via wap-interviewer; wap-supervisor sound)\n\nFixed in [578bbee7](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/578bbee78b62c421a03d12cc994335146d92bfd6): merge origin/main into the landing of theory-effects-typed",
