  "column_since": "2026-11-24T19:49:57Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiJp__Q",
   "title": "explicit prelude files can't overload a name",
   "body": "Original title: The theory's explicit prelude files can't overload a name, so any.wap and operators.wap are read by the elaborator itself\n\nFound by the theory-sums audit (2058d31b). Explicit statements go statement_checked → declared (bindings.wap:33, typing.wap:151-152), and names_new refuses a second name. Overloads are made only by overload_key (elaborate/declare.wap:90-96) on the elaborator path. Wanted: explicit declarations join an overload set through the same key rule, so prelude any.wap and operators.wap become explicit files. Cost: check.wap then sees convert, + and any. Also: prelude/operators.wap copies wap/types/operators.wap's table.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316762245\n\nAnother case: prelude/conversions.wap holds convert(b: bool): Prop as an elaborated file only because the explicit data.wap cannot declare a second convert beside the Subset one (branch theory-subtypes-rest). Also file.wap PRELUDE_ELABORATED: theory-sums sets [operators, any], this branch [operators, conversions]; the second to land merges to [operators, conversions, any].\n\nbranch: theory-explicit-overloads (2026-11-24)\n\nSupervisor audit e7b9f2b9: sound after fixes — declared_name renames 2nd prelude overload during load (prove or fix, add line), exact-count uses binders_counted (counts result arrows), unify the two letters rules + one key rendering, test file to test/, is_sort dup.\n\naudit fixes at c92a40ba (one key function overloaded(), own binder count for the exact-count rule, is_sort once); sent to wap-supervisor for sound\n\nSupervisor: c92a40ba sound (declared_name not hiding during load, own binder count, one key function; two found-count sources kept by design).\n\nland: theory-explicit-overloads c92a40ba\n\nFixed in [d2b4fea4](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d2b4fea4f46c0f796cfa20fa9f209146e1e74899): merge theory-explicit-overloads: the theory's overloads written explicitly (wap-supervisor sound)",
