  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiMOdlw",
   "title": "class extending another does not get the base's…",
   "body": "Original title: A class extending another with typed defaults or methods does not get the base's defaults and methods\n\nFollow-up to class-inheritance (wap-supervisor): inherited splices the base Record's fields as declared, so a base field default and its methods are not re-expanded in the extending class. Proposed: re-expand the base's members (the class statement as written) instead of the declared record. Owner: wap-binding.\n\nAdded by wap-binding with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316928604\n\nbranch: typed-default-inheritance (2026-11-24)\n\nSupervisor: nominal shape (base as @extends annotation, fits follows the base chain, ~8 core) sent to wap-interviewer for the user's core OK; structural prefix rejected (unrelated classes, empty bases). stage.wap declared_name default case: standing-OK 1-line fix, reviewed with the branch.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: a subclass fits where its base is wanted, by declared base (the extends chain), ~8 net core (templates.wap annotation holes, fits.wap base chain); field matching was rejected. Run-time dispatch is a follow-on. Small overruns are decided by the interviewer.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: about 13 core (7 typing + 6 emitter): a subclass's wasm struct is declared a subtype of its base's struct, and passes accepts a subtype with no run-time cast. The run-time cast alternative was rejected.\n\nreview cd022e01: sound after fixes. core net 18 code lines (decl_name 1, extended 5, fits 4, emitter 8) vs ~13 OK. Fixes: rename extended (clash types/memory_lists.wap:54); unknown base must refuse (values.wap:186); supertype_passes only along declared bases (functions.wap:129); test mid-build base reservation; share annotation-word helper with calls.wap:374; outcome lines for nominal refusals; full suite for declared_name (51 callers); native subclass test; backbone.md:287 stale. Supervisor.\n\n9bbcc392: sound (fixes in; mid-build supertype bug found+fixed; refusal lines rightly not pinned). core net 16 vs ~13: overrun 3 with wap-interviewer (margin rule). Supervisor.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer, standing: small overrun. 16 net core against ~13 (the shared annotation helper, a loud refusal of an unknown base, the enum base kept out of the subtype walk). Tip 9bbcc392, supervisor audit sound.\n\nland: typed-default-inheritance 9bbcc392 — core 16 net code lines, accepted by interviewer 2026-11-24; supervisor audit sound; patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/typed-default-inheritance/typed-default-inheritance-9bbcc392.patch\n\nFixed in [9cea8d18](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/9cea8d187dfd66dc3417030f9c8466052da8da4f): merge typed-default-inheritance: a subclass's struct is a wasm subtype of its base's (user OK ~13 core, +16 accepted by wap-interviewer; wap-supervisor sound)",
