   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiNVg5Q",
   "title": "A law can't say and, or, implies or not",
   "body": "Added by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316992225\n\nbranch: law-logical-connectives (2026-11-24)\n\nbranch theory-implies, tip 14f223ce. review: sound after fixes. Test :16 pins Assumed where laws.md:36-42 says Proved; :15 'not (2<1)' route unclear; introduction.wap:38 attempt must wrap whole body, :27-28 ! crashes; facts.wap unused uses; instance_of unfolding untested; bool beside Prop operators needs a run. Supervisor.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-24 (core) via wap-interviewer: Q2 a direct overload fit beats a fit through a conversion; only equal fits tie. Measure first; a few lines are fine, a big count comes back. Q1 decided by the interviewer (sugar, the wiki already says it): the and/or sugar fires only on bool operands; between propositions and/or are And/Or (wiki/proposition.md table stays).\n\nFixed in [bbf59f55](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/bbf59f556155fd90eca25e3774d3c4a0150db8f0): merge theory-implies: laws joined by logical connectives, implies among them (wap-supervisor sound)\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-24: wiki/polymorphism.md passage approved (a direct fit beats a fit through a conversion; equal fits are ambiguous, naming both); built in extensions/theory, about 10 lines, 0 core.\n\nbranch law-logical-connectives tip 4178500e (+ wiki branch law-logical-connectives fdeceab, interviewer-approved polymorphism.md passage): And/Or between propositions, direct overload fit wins, bool not; to wap-supervisor for sound\n\nreview 4178500e: sound after fixes. conditions.wap:49-50 'if p then yes else no' on undecided Prop becomes Or(p, no) bypassing the refusal (conditions.wap:4); If(A,yes,no) should be A; read.wap:327/342 trials_of doesn't restore x.indirect (nested losing trials leak counts, skipped on throw). OK: wiki passage on wiki branch fdeceab; wanted→green move. read.wap +12 vs ~7: overrun to interviewer after fixes. Supervisor.\n\nreview c99b35fc (supervisor): sound after — drop the two refusal test lines (outcome tests never pin a refusal; the comparison-choice line stays); save/restore of x.indirect written twice (declarations_tried, trials_of) becomes one name. read.wap code +18/-4 (net +14) vs ~7 approved: overrun sent to wap-interviewer.\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-24, standing: small overrun: +10 to +12 extension lines in extensions/theory/elaborate/read.wap (after the save/restore is named once) for the approved direct-fit rule; 0 core. Accepted. If it stays at +14 after naming, that is accepted too.\n\nland: law-logical-connectives fff5a98b (+ wiki law-logical-connectives fdeceab)\n\nFixed in [87552b92](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/87552b92522ea8d91c4b46a7e6d23f0305060149): merge law-logical-connectives: between propositions nothing decides, and and or are And and Or, the closest overload fit wins (wap-supervisor sound)",
