  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-24T23:49:53Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiPcT9w",
   "title": "The elaborator takes time exponential in the…",
   "body": "Original title: The elaborator takes time exponential in the length of an operator chain: a + b + c + d + e + f + g never finishes\n\nMeasured with the census door (branch theory-census, wap/extensions/theory/elaborate/census.wap): overload trials for one statement: t + 1 → 28, + t → 168, 4 terms → 868, 5 → 4368 (1.8 s), 6 → 21868 (4.4 s), 7 → >60 s, 2 GB. Each overloaded call tries every candidate (read.wap trials_of/declarations_tried), and each trial elaborates its arguments again, so nesting multiplies. Fix idea: elaborate an argument once per wanted type (memo), or elaborate the arguments first and choose by their types. Until then TRIAL_LIMIT (read.wap) refuses a statement past 10000 trials, so the census (test/wap/ratchet_census.sh) terminates; the census count shows the gain.\n\nAdded by wap-fixer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317125685\n\nHung case: lib/markdown.wap:95 table_cell(tag: text, align: text, content: text): text := \"<${tag}${if align == \"\" then \"\" else \" align=\\\"${align}\\\"\"}>${inline_html(content)}</${tag}>\" — the census sat 10 min at 2.2 GB on it. Smallest: f(t: nat): nat := t + 1 + t + 2 + t + 3 + t (7 terms).\n\nbranch: elaborate-overload-exponential (2026-11-24)\n\nreview 0982fb6c (supervisor): unsound — read_alone leaks letters/instances/indirect/pending; it-arguments must stay Written; Recursor branch dropped in declared_read; trait-operation trials still exponential; Written map x3 + name clash with declare.wap class Written. Decided (rare, supervisor): an argument's overload is chosen by its own arguments first, then converted (k(g(a)) picks g(A); the old tie refusal goes).\n\nRe-audit b8f4a4ed (wap-supervisor): sound after fixes. put_back on re-raise paths (read.wap:400,312); Snapshot + lifts/without_course/round_given/levels, union_typed same; error-path re-reads accepted (TRIAL_LIMIT refuses loudly, comment at read.wap:288); rename test line 16. Decided: _ sort hole with nothing wanted, and args read alone then made_of domain = bottom-up rule.\n\nland: elaborate-overload-exponential 1a8158ed (wap-supervisor sound; normal path: theory+operators 412 ✓, wanted reds only)\n\nFixed in [b73f7a84](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/b73f7a8406c0f73310685a5176a014d8375cb575): merge elaborate-overload-exponential: a call trying several declarations reads each argument once, so a chain of overloaded operators is linear (wap-supervisor sound)",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "assignees": {
