   "body": "Original title: A function with untyped parameters gets its type from its body or from each call\n\nBranch theory-untyped (wap-theory-conditions-lifted). wiki/function.md:24/:33, proposition.md:34. Topic dependent-types. Every branch has a card; this one lands the branch.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317180759\n\nbranch: theory-untyped (2026-11-25)\n\nbranch theory-untyped tip 3764e9e2 (on top of elaborate-overload-exponential 1a8158ed): untyped parameters body-first else a template per call, for-lines as parameters, nat→int conversion; theory+operators 416 ✓ wanted reds only; in wap-supervisor review\n\nAudit 3764e9e2 (wap-supervisor): sound after fixes. Snapshot body-first attempt + reuse refusal test; for-only law reads as written; decided: typed fitting declaration beats template (template tried when none fits); version key by term equality, free caller variables refuse with fix-it; dedupe test line 15.\n\ntip 9974d18f: supervisor fixes 1-4 done (theory snapshot, for-only laws, template after typed candidates, versions by equal); 416 ✓ wanted reds only; waits for elaborate-overload-exponential to land, then handoff\n\n9974d18f: sound (wap-supervisor). Fixes 1-4 in; test line 15 kept (only green check of for lines).\n\nland: theory-untyped 54e80b39 (wap-supervisor sound; normal path: theory+operators 416 ✓ wanted reds only, test_hello green, growth 0)\n\nFixed in [3cc59908](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/3cc599086fce96cf4a35d20324dd746d92c50562): merge theory-untyped: a function's untyped parameters take their types from its body, else it is a template with one version per kind of argument; a law's leading for lines are its parameters (wap-supervisor sound)",
