  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABh59f7w",
   "title": "A library value hides every function of its name…",
   "body": "Original title: A library value hides every function of its name in calls: use units breaks min(1, 2)\n\nunits.wap's value min = unit(…) hides numbers' min(a, b): min(1, 2) is refused as 'min: Quantity is no function to call' (wap-host-port-window, blocks lib/sound.wap). Rule (A, wap-lead): a call chooses among what can be called; where the nearest definition is a value of no function type, the functions of its name further out take the call, with a note. Branch call-skips-value (/Volumes/Worktrees/module-global-2). Waits for the user's yes (night: core growth in the morning).\n\nAdded by wap-binding with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=315754551\n\nBuilt: branch call-skips-value 917b3210, +12 net core lines (8 code, 4 comment): bindings.wap FUNCTIONS_BEYOND (+2), names.wap functions_named + with_functions_beyond (+4, rule_word_meant reuses functions_named), scope.wap 0, function_values.wap called_beyond (+6). min(1, 2) beside use units gives 1 with a note; 2min unchanged; size = 3; size(1) still refused; a lambda variable still wins. units, unit, calls, functions, lambda, records, dynamic green but wanted files; hello green. Test line in test_units.wap. Waits for the user's yes.\n\nbranch: call-skips-value (2026-11-25)\n\nrebased on main 665da486 as branch call-skips-value-2 (cherry-pick of 917b3210; scope.wap conflict beside the field-capture line); still red on main, fixed on the branch: min(1, 2) gives 1 with the note; hello, growth, units unit calls functions lambda records dynamic green (4 wanted files red as on main). +11 net core: asked the user via wap-interviewer 2026-11-25. Old branch call-skips-value / worktree module-global-2 superseded.\n\nuser OK 2026-11-25 (core) via wap-interviewer: A, a call skips a nearer non-function value and takes the function further out, with a note; core +11 in analyze, branch call-skips-value-2\n\nuser OK 2026-11-25 (A, +11 core) via wap-interviewer; land: call-skips-value-2 eb587012 (handed to wap-integrator)\n\nFixed in [b052ec73](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/b052ec73ff0fb2939981483978934a059ba6e61f): merge call-skips-value: a call chooses among what can be called; a nearer value of no function type leaves the call to the functions of its name further out, with a note (use units beside min(1, 2) gives 1) (user OK 2026-11-25 via wap-interviewer)\n\ndup?: library-value (by score, 2026-11-26)",
