  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiAvoKA",
   "title": "native program cannot use a map",
   "body": "Original title: A native program cannot use a map: native builds have no memory layout for maps\n\nFound by wap-enum-index-constant-time on any-layout-missing (7d9261e0): a native build refuses {} (map<any, any>) with its line, since memory builds have no map layout. Part of the native binary (user priority). Layout work in core/emit goes to wap-interviewer before it's built.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316176997\n\nbranch: native-maps (2026-11-24)\n\nbranch native-maps tip e1a769ea: map in memory = address of keys/values/slots lists (types/memory_lists.wap), literal built by calls (core/analyze/data.wap +3 lines incl. comment, 0 emit). hello, test_native (new line 'a native program's maps'), map_helpers, maps_page green; growth clean. Waiting for wap-interviewer's OK on the core lines.\n\nReleased 2026-11-24 by wap-native-maps: done: native maps built and green (hello, test_native with 'a native program's maps', map_helpers, maps_page, growth); left: wap-interviewer's OK on +2 core/analyze lines (data.wap map_typed memory branch), then merge origin/main, checks, hand to wap-integrator; branch: native-maps e1a769ea\n\nbranch native-maps-2 6e90db91 (fresh from main, old native-maps e1a769ea superseded): map layout row + memory_lists words; core +1 (data.wap map_typed memory line + entry_parts; word key a text in every build, emitter's symbol case gone). hello, native, c, map_helpers, maps_page green. Waiting: user OK via wap-interviewer.\n\nstanding OK small fix (wap-supervisor sound 6e90db91)\n\nland: native-maps-2 ff51f049 (hello, growth, native c map_helpers maps_page 110 ✓); origin/native-maps superseded\n\nFixed in [2a7eeaf5](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/2a7eeaf500d857c8fe4f6c404f0d4fe8bcb7e3b9): merge native-maps-2: a native program's maps live in the memory through the layout's map row, typing writing the literal as calls of types/memory_lists.wap words as a list's; a word key is its text, the emitter's symbol case gone (standing OK small fix, core +1, wap-supervisor sound)\n\nuser 2026-11-26 via interviewer: native-maps-2 confirmed after the fact, core +1, +284 nodes",
