   "title": "wap format on a file outside the wap tree fails",
   "body": "Original title: wap format on a file outside the wap tree fails: it looks for types/host.wap beside the file instead of beside the compiler\n\nSeen by wap-emitter: format of <dir>/x.wap says 'cannot read <dir>/../types/host.wap'. The tree is found from the program's folder, not the compiler's. Owner: wap-reader (format).\n\nAdded by wap-reader with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316264069\n\nbranch: format-outside-tree (2026-11-25)\n\nfixed on main 665da486: wap format of a file outside the tree (the session scratchpad) formats it, with the installed wap and the tree's",
