  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiRXxpg",
   "title": "xs += [x] copies the whole list instead of…",
   "body": "Original title: xs += [x] copies the whole list instead of growing it in place as the wiki says\n\nwiki/list.md:69 (+= grows in place), :211 (lists shared, x.copy() copies). Core rewrites every a ⊕= b to a = a ⊕ b (core/parse/keys.wap:45), so list += copies: quadratic. Found by wap-binding: theory hypotheses += went 47 s → 4.3 s with .add. Decided (A) by wap-interviewer 2026-11-25 02:17, standing OK small fix: a type may declare its own +=, list's appends in place (types/lists.wap), universal rewrite stays the fallback; keys.wap lookup ≤3 net lines after supervisor sound, else waits for the user. Snapshot sites relying on the copy (found_so_far, el.problems, level_problems …) take an explicit .copy(), found by a census run. Path: careful (self build, census).\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317246130\n\nbranch: list-append-in-place (2026-11-25)\n\nWIP tip 0e7d05e3: declared += found via COMPOUND fact on the inner call (keys.wap 0 net, calls.wap +2 code +1 use); snapshot fixes conditions.wap present_typed, calls.wap body_typed found_in copy, theory Found/back_to, lifted.wap; area tests running\n\nland: list-append-in-place 229941b5 — careful path green: test_hello, lists/list/theory areas (only the known _wanted reds), test_self, census --theory; size ceiling raised 142815→142920 in its own commit; patch /Volumes/Worktrees/list-append-in-place/data/list-append-in-place.patch\n\nAudit 229941b5: sound-after-fixes; core +3 net (standing OK, interviewer decision A); ceiling raise +105 accepted. Fixes: per-instance = [] defaults verified, += reads as + on untyped/any lists, stale test label, dedupe keys.wap:46 and state.wap copies. (wap-supervisor)\n\nland: list-append-in-place ff4a0a03 (merge of origin/main; supervisor's 4 points done; careful path green on the merge; size ceiling 142934)\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-25 03:58: +4 net core (ff4a0a03) is past the standing OK's hard limit of 3 (a cap, not an estimate), so it goes to the user in the morning; recommendation: accept, since the 4th line is the written_as dedupe. Not landed before the user's yes.\n\nstate: land: list-append-in-place 80a930fa — core +3 net lines counting comments (code +2); supervisor audit points 1-4 done; careful path green on this tip (test_hello, lists/list/theory with only the old _wanted reds, test_self, census --theory, growth); size ceiling 142934; waiting for the integrator to land; then todo done + worktree removal\n\n80a930fa: +3 net core (checked), standing OK small fix; sound (wap-supervisor); the morning question is dropped.\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-25: the morning question is dropped; tip 80a930fa is +3 net core, inside the standing OK.\n\nFixed in [5b0e7daf](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/5b0e7daf377be732201220c70c574be761618a3e): merge list-append-in-place: a list's += grows it in place, a type may declare its own compound operator (standing OK small fix, wap-supervisor sound)",
