   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiSKpNw",
   "title": "The theory's wanted test lines pass",
   "body": "Red lines of test/wap/test_theory_*_wanted.wap (connectives, numbers, recursors, statements, subtypes, quotients, effects, elaborate) plus test_laws_wanted/test_proof_wanted, each made green the general way. Not read.wap use/modules or the census (theory-reads-use). Path: normal. (wap-supervisor)\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317294575\n\nbranch: theory-wanted-reds (2026-11-25)\n\nDecided (wap-supervisor): a short-form law's free names are its parameters, typed by use (wiki/laws.md 'same law as the short form'). A nameless law reports under the first function its statement calls, else 'law <its line>'; shared labels are not special-cased.\n\nAlso yours: 'this list has no item at this place', an index out of range inside the elaborator instead of a refusal, about 10 census statements (lib/time x2, bits, ini, regex, toml, yaml, core/emit/lists, types/prelude, types/types); on main too. Found by theory-reads-use. (wap-supervisor)\n\nDecided (wap-supervisor): a top-level x = v is a definition only when nothing else sets x (the file's units, function bodies, used modules); otherwise refused as a definition, naming the other place. nat? in argument position (core lowering, ~2 lines) is with wap-interviewer.\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-25: [T, ?] keeps the optional form in phrase_lowered (core/rules/lowering.wap, about 2 core), standing OK once wap-reviewer says sound. A wiki grep finds no expression meaning of a postfix ?: it marks only types and fields (optional.md, null.md, type.md, argument.md name?); a ? in regex and sql templates sits inside text.\n\nland: theory-wanted-reds 7e93d55b (contains theory-run-terms 81e3bd83). Green: constants set once (wiki/subtype.md char line), nat? as argument (lowering, standing OK small fix), short laws, print is io, missing arguments refused. Census 2060 (floor raised), size 142941. Left red in _wanted: twice_doubles over int, effects other: Tested, refl from wanted type, name#1, dot/vector, statements line pins a refusal.\n\naudit 7e93d55b (wap-supervisor): not sound. The constant rule misses sets inside function bodies and blocks (places_set via nodes_in skips Calls) and sets in used modules; a same-line second set passes; no test of the refusal. OK: +7 ceiling, core net 0, refusal_only\n\nland: theory-wanted-reds 9de977f0 (on theory-run-terms a9ab0da4). Audit points 1-5 fixed (aaffd901 + merge 218fbd95). Census 2168, size 142941.\n\nreview 9de977f0: sound (wap-supervisor), incl. lowering.wap nat? line (standing OK small fix, net 0); floor 2168\n\nFixed in [5f0beedb](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/5f0beedbec0dd1bfb1a8e2fe138469ca44bb6078): merge theory-wanted-reds: the theory's wanted lines green, a constant rule seeing sets in bodies, branches and used modules, `nat?` stays optional in lowering (standing OK small fix; wap-supervisor sound, floor and ceiling OK)",
