 "theory-reads-types": {
  "id": "PVTI_lAHOAAfgFs4BsfrazhLq9sk",
  "title": "The theory reads the words every program gets",
  "updated": "2026-11-25T11:34:39Z",
  "key": "theory-reads-types",
  "agent": "wap-theory-reads-types",
  "try": "",
  "repeat": "",
  "now_by_todo": "2026-11-25T08:17:42Z",
  "assignees": [
   "pannous"
  ],
  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-25T11:34:39Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiTo0_g",
   "title": "The theory reads the words every program gets",
   "body": "Original title: The theory reads the words every program gets, so a test's check and print are understood\n\nStep 2 of theory-reads-use. Decisions (wap-supervisor): the types module is one more module of modules_of, found through the names code uses, cached per census; refused types statements taken back, a program word hitting one refused naming it. A prim body is an opaque constant of its declared type, only for data or computation types, never a proposition.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317388489\n\nbranch: theory-reads-types (2026-11-25)\n\n(wap-supervisor) A declaration hides a prelude name only with the same signature (a type has none), else an overload. A self-named call resolves by overloads and is recursion only when it picks this declaration (refines c31bd3de)\n\n(wap-supervisor) same signature in types module and prelude: prelude's reading stands, types body is the host spelling; pairs listed in notes/theory.md run trust base. write gets its real effect type in types/text_bytes.wap (careful path)\n\n(wap-supervisor OK) d5ac9b2e: in a type's place, an overload giving a type or proposition fits before one giving data, then the usual measures; restores implies/not/bool readings\n\nreview 24b4cf31: not sound. 1 every types fn runs as host call (erase.wap:57, declare.wap:171) vs decision B; 2 Prop refusal misses type-variable results (declare.wap:138); 3 theory.md:332 misses <=; 4 held/copied O(stmts×types decls); 5 unit_taken reads unit#1 only; 6 binders ?? 0 silent; 7 dupes from_prelude/module_key. Sent to worker.\n\nreview 1657a9e8: not sound, 8 items (layouts not taken back; program prim hosts by name; prelude_signature ignores result; text + missing in trust base; 'hosted proposition' wording; silent file_of ?? \"\" / letters_found ?? 0; source_key dup; tests for A and later-node refusal). wap-theory-conditions-lifted retired; respawned as wap-theory-reads-types with the list.\n\n(wap-worker) audit of 1657a9e8 fixed on theory-reads-types e51b5194: layouts taken back by count (taken_back), program prim refused (host's operation), signature compares result, hosted proposition kind, file_key loud + language per unit, preloaded one fn, enum/class names recorded on refusal (declared_words read blocks as written: before, a refused enum block recorded none) + dotted owner, trust base twins derived. Theory areas green; census 2208 ≥ 2168 but ratio 4 > 3 under load 16: A/B timing vs 1657a9e8 running.\n\nland: theory-reads-types 4e037914 (path careful: hello ✓, theory areas ✓ (only _wanted red, as before), census 2208 ≥ 2168, ratio 303/112 < 3, growth ✓). Patch: ~/Library/Logs/warp/theory-reads-types/theory-reads-types.patch\n\n4e037914 not sound: map.walked() undefined in take_back (read.wap:134), overwritten layout keys missed; duplicate +(text,text) silent first-wins; prelude_signature result untested. Sent to worker.\n\nsecond audit fixed: 9aadd27f (merged after slice 2): layouts recorded by name + laid out once, result-signature test, list literal read per overload. hello ✓ theory areas ✓ census 2217, ratio < 3. Awaiting wap-supervisor sound, then re-hand to wap-integrator.\n\n9aadd27f: claims 1-3 sound; read_alone list-literal special case (read.wap:275,462) not sound: generalize to 'unread while a numeral's type is open', comment, test line. Laid-twice take-back: no program reaches it, accepted untested.\n\nland: theory-reads-types d8251713 (replaces 4e037914; supervisor reviews 2+3 fixed; hello ✓, theory areas ✓, census 2216, ratio < 3). Awaiting wap-supervisor sound on the 6dd2fbc0 narrowing, then wap-integrator lands.\n\nreview (supervisor): d8251713 sound. The rule is narrowed to values built of cases (any constructor, any depth); a call's result is left to nearest. The grouped-list test was added and removed within the branch, so no test on main is lost.\n\nFixed in [d3ad4b63](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d3ad4b63cbcb621089f58e34c7bc9091c3beea58): merge theory-reads-types: the theory reads the types module a program's words name; a host's operation is a constant of a data type; the prelude's reading stands on equal signatures; a number is read at the type its place wants (wap-supervisor sound)",
   "state": "CLOSED",
