   "body": "interviewer 2026-11-25, notes/audit/2026-11-25.md Edge cases 1. Plus audit tangentials: memory_lists pop on empty, native atol silent 0, effects.md malformed comment. branch: bools-as-numbers-dropped\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317650254\n\nbranch: bools-as-numbers-dropped (2026-11-25)\n\nland: bools-as-numbers-dropped b152a9c6 + wiki branch bools-as-numbers-dropped (7852b11). One expected red: test_truthiness_page '0 and 5' gives no (wiki: 0); it was hidden by the dropped no == 0 overload; cause sugar/conditions.wap:28; a held-left fix breaks narrowing in 'x != ø and x.f', so the fix is core typing work\n\n031403f2 + wiki 6a37ffa/7852b11: wap-supervisor sound (diff-audit). Waits on interviewer ruling on truthiness 0 and 5. Stale remote branch native-cap-numbers (pushed by mistake) awaits cleanup.\n\nsound (wap-supervisor) at 031403f2; land: bools-as-numbers-dropped 031403f2 + wiki branch bools-as-numbers-dropped (7852b11). Red: test_truthiness_page '0 and 5' waits for the interviewer. Split out: native-cap-option-numbers (cd1c8fce) waits for the user's OK on card native-binary. Stale remote branch native-cap-numbers (82406d1b, pushed by mistake) to delete, via wap-interviewer.\n\nland: bools-as-numbers-dropped 61ff02aa + wiki branch dad5e63; all green, no reds (interviewer dropped the 0 and 5 line; cap_given OK'd). Stale remote branches native-cap-numbers and native-cap-option-numbers: in the user's cleanup script.\n\nFixed in [469c0857](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/469c0857206d8416cd7545ed1683a014657b08cf): merge bools-as-numbers-dropped: a bool is no number, == takes no (int, bool) pair; an empty native list's pop raises; the rare 0 and 5 line leaves; a cap option takes only a whole number (interviewer 2026-11-25, wap-supervisor sound, driver fix user OK 2026-11-25)",
