   "body": "Original title: The kernel names declarations by number, so two modules may each declare their own same name\n\nAdded by wap-theory-reads-types with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=317950619\n\nbranch: name-declaration-number (2026-11-25)\n\nbranch: kernel-ids (stacked on kernel-log 3ea22718)\n\nstage 1 fe11993a (+census): a block's types are checker variables, holding's axioms gone from the check; hello + 22 theory tests 383 ✓; census 165266. Next: Constant(id) (~160 sites, 35 files), then module scopes\n\nland: kernel-ids 3de3e766 (contains kernel-log 5f400ead and its stack; patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/kernel-t2/kernel-ids.patch). T2d done: Constant(id); facts, projections, bindings, quotients and axioms by id; names_new gone; one scope per module (kernel: ids own + outer, taken_back; elaborate/file.wap in_scope). New test lines in test_theory_elaborate: two modules declaring Side. Checks on the merge with main ecd9714b: hello ✓, compiler-growth ✓, theory 388 ✓, census ✓ (ceiling 166086).\n\nland: kernel-ids 72a57632 (merged with main 6def7046; contains kernel-log). Census loss fixed: the census's copied theories share the env since T2c, now each keeps its own scope (KeptScope) and courses go by id: theory 2364 of 11857 (main 2279; identical refusals outside wap/kernel), ratio 1.4, size 166165, theory set 388 ✓, hello ✓, growth ✓.\n\nFixed in [d60bf285](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/d60bf285db90ff4d79cdc3735c2cd4776cd62d71): merge kernel-ids: T2a to T2d of the coc plan. The kernel's twelve files in wap/kernel, kernel numbers i64 with overflow checks, the environment one log with scoped take-backs, a constant its declaration's id, one scope per module, each census theory its own scope (cards kernel-move, kernel-numbers, kernel-log, kernel-ids; the user's track-T decisions 2026-11-25; wap-supervisor: sound)",
