   "body": "Original title: The census stops counting the theory's accepted statements now that the kernel's own tests cover it\n\nT2f of notes/coc-t2.md: --theory, THEORY_ACCEPTED and THEORY_TIME_RATIO leave test/wap/ratchet_census.sh; scripts/theory-census.wap stays for whoever wants its numbers, and the kept scope (scope_kept/scope_entered) moves out of the kernel into it (supervisor: KeptScope only stays where TM or the kernel reads it). Builds on kernel-rules.\n\nAdded by wap-theory-reads-types with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=318316695\n\nbranch: theory-census-retire (2026-11-25)\n\nland: theory-census-retire 99045f26 (patch ~/Library/Logs/warp/kernel-t2/theory-census-retire.patch)\n\nFixed in [59a4edd3](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/59a4edd31bb57c5148c7716981fddfe44255d284): merge theory-census-retire: T2f of the coc plan, the theory census retires from the ratchets (--theory, THEORY_ACCEPTED and THEORY_TIME_RATIO leave ratchet_census.sh; scripts/theory-census.wap stays); size 167121 with KeptScope gone (user's T2 plan; wap-supervisor: sound)",
