 "facts-by-name-speed": {
  "id": "PVTI_lAHOAAfgFs4BsfrazhL9CCU",
  "title": "A node's facts are found by comparing their names…",
  "updated": "2026-11-26T17:09:04Z",
  "key": "facts-by-name-speed",
  "agent": "wap-primitive-lookup-tables",
  "try": "",
  "repeat": "",
  "now_by_todo": "2026-11-26T00:46:00Z",
  "assignees": [
   "pannous"
  ],
  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-26T02:12:02Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABimVEYw",
   "title": "A node's facts are found by comparing their names…",
   "body": "Original title: A node's facts are found by comparing their names as text one by one: about a tenth of the self compile's own work\n\nMeasured at main 31e3fcc9 (sample + wasmtime perfmap of the self compile): self time in ==(text, text) 4.4%, fact_name 3.6%, fact_of 2.6%, meta_unwrapped 2.5% (core/stage.wap fact_of/has_fact walk the Meta's Key list comparing names byte by byte; types/texts.wap == has no identity fast path). Candidates: (a) text == answers yes at once for the same reference (a kernel primitive for reference identity, which wap lacks); (b) fact names as an enum or interned ids, compared as ints. (a) is the smaller core cost and speeds every text comparison. Kernel/core change: to the user via warp-interviewer.\n\nAdded by wap-primitive-lookup-tables with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=318572581\n\nbranch: facts-by-name-speed (2026-11-26)\n\ninterviewer OK 2026-11-26 night (0 net core speedup). branch facts-by-name-speed 78520c74: same_place fast path in text ==, 1.4% fewer instructions retired on the self compile.\n\nland: facts-by-name-speed 78520c74\n\nland: facts-by-name-speed 7d327b66\n\nFixed in [dc97d6d9](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/dc97d6d957166df9cfdad65a74059c47cdd1f623): merge facts-by-name-speed: text == answers yes at once for one text (a ref.eq primitive row, one_text in the text words), 1.4% fewer instructions on the self compile for +65 nodes (0 net core; interviewer OK 2026-11-26 at night, wap-supervisor sound)\n\nProfile 2026-11-26 on main 90782c24 (after funcref): fact lookups by text name take about 20% of a self-compile's busy time: text == 9.4% self, fact_name 6.3%, fact_of 4.5% (wasm-merged wap1 under wasmtime with perfmap and /usr/bin/sample). Needs core (core/stage.wap): fact ids in place of names.\n\ndup?: interned-names (by score, 2026-11-26)",
