   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABhr8vhQ",
   "title": "Sound and MIDI play in native wap through SDL3",
   "body": "Original title: Sound and MIDI should play in a native wap build through SDL3 and CoreMIDI\n\nBranch native-sound, 8 commits unlanded (host.wap sound words over SDL3, MP3 by libmpg123, MIDI over CoreMIDI, missing C functions stop only when called). notes/native.md on the branch.\n\nbranch: native-sound (parked, found without a card by the board keeper 2026-11-23; tip 63a220d)\n\nAdded by wap-board with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=314874277\n\nbranch: native-sound-silent (2026-11-27)\n\nnative-sound branch (63a220dd, 2026-11-21 host.wasm design) superseded: main's lib/host/native_host/sound.wap answers all 8 sound words (SDL3, AudioToolbox, libmpg123 LAME length, CoreMIDI); its one core bit (matcher rest-hole separator) served host.wap's template texts only. New branch native-sound-silent 97ef4b5d: muted render tests. Old branch can be deleted.\n\nland: native-sound-silent 97ef4b5d\n\nsuperseded by lib/host/native_host/sound.wap on main; the old branch native-sound (tip 63a220dd, 2026-11-22) deleted by the integrator; test_sound runs it muted, landed at dcbf962b",
