  "column_since": "2026-11-26T11:31:31Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiGP8lQ",
   "title": "a match inside a call's argument is refused as a…",
   "body": "Original title: a match inside a call's argument is refused as a parameter: f(…) := Block(match p { A => a; _ => b } + rest)\n\nFrom wap-emitter (E5): the reader refuses with 'a parameter is a name, or a name and its type'. A match is an expression and may stand as an operand. Owner: wap-reader, after nullish-raise-refusal.\n\nAdded by wap-supervisor with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316533091\n\ninterviewer 2026-11-24, decided without a user question (rare form): B, parentheses stay required: (match p {…}) + rest; the refusal gets a fix-it naming that spelling. 0 core beyond the error text.\n\nuser via interviewer 2026-11-24: parentheses stay required; the refusal gets a fix-it naming `(match …) + rest`.\n\nbranch: match-inside (2026-11-24)\n\nReleased 2026-11-24 by wap-reader: done: `match p {…} + rest` refused with the fix-it to bracket the whole phrase, test line in test_matching; left: census size red by 117 nodes (139362 > 139245): find a cheaper spot or raise the ceiling in its own test: commit naming match-inside (supervisor), then hand off; branch: match-inside, tip befe4ed2 (pushed), worktree /Volumes/Worktrees/match-inside\n\nland: match-inside 7898027e (merged with main, size ceiling +117 in own commit, TODO.md stash note; matching/operators/reader/rules 215 ✓)\n\nFixed in [bc12309c](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/bc12309c53ef5dbf04318f11a6c49d630812124c): merge match-inside: a block-leading phrase followed by an infix operator, match p { … } + rest, is refused with the fix-it naming (… { … }) + …; test_matching gains the bracketed form; a TODO.md line for the stash-failed merge oddity (user 2026-11-24 via wap-interviewer: the refusal with its fix-it, +6 core; wap-supervisor: sound at 7898027e)",
