   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABiLBfuQ",
   "title": "natively built program with an empty class does…",
   "body": "Original title: A natively built program with an empty class, or an enum beside a class, does not build\n\nNative build on origin/main: `class Flag {}` fails because the class rule writes join([], \", \") and the empty list stays list<any>; `enum Color {Red, Green}` beside `class Wide {x: float}` fails with 'no layout for any: show(any)'. Found by native-function-values (fixer).\n\nAdded by wap-fixer with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=316850981\n\nbranch: native-no-layout-any (2026-11-26)\n\nland: native-no-layout-any 090bc7b9 — standing OK small fix (0 net core lines; wap-reviewer not running, diff-audit clean): a memory build exports no dispatchers of any values (enum beside class failed on text(any)); the class rule's shown fields are a list<text> (class Flag {} left an unsettled list<any>). native/records/class/enum 131 ✓, hello + growth green\n\nFixed in [b42962c8](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/b42962c848f154ecede00982aaf6cf89f0e8bc95): merge native-no-layout-any: a memory-values build exports no dispatchers of any values, since it has no any layout, and the class rule types its shown fields as list<text>, so an enum beside a class and an empty class build natively; wap's size ceiling rises to the measured 179009 nodes (+15, the shown fields' type) (standing OK small fix, 0 net core; wap-supervisor: sound at 090bc7b9)",
