  "column": "Done",
  "column_since": "2026-11-26T20:15:44Z",
  "content": {
   "__typename": "Issue",
   "id": "I_kwDOV1nZQs8AAAABioeXqg",
   "title": "A case name two used enums share stops working as…",
   "body": "Original title: A case name two used enums share stops working as a parameter type, even inside the module that declares one of them\n\nPre-existing (the seed does the same), found reviewing T3b: s.wap has enum Shape { Circle(r: int), … } and radius(c: Circle); t.wap has enum Figure { Circle(name: text), Dot }. A program using both gets 'no radius takes (Shape)': core/analyze/shapes.wap shaped() narrows a case word only when exactly one record of the whole typing state holds a case of that name, not the records the writing module sees. Fix direction: scope binds a case word written as a type to its enum (as type_bound binds a record name with DECLARED_BY), and shaped reads that.\n\nAdded by wap-theory-reads-types with `todo add`.\n\nBoard card: https://github.com/users/pannous/projects/10?pane=issue&itemId=318703669\n\nbranch: case-name (2026-11-26)\n\nbranch case-name 112cbe8c: a case word written as a type narrows the enum its module's scope sees (scope.wap type_bound and case_owner write the narrows fact; type_notation.wap word_named keys the case's word by that enum's declaration, as case_shape does). Green: test_hello, growth, modules (new line) / enum_page / matching / pattern_matching_page, test_self, the census except size +135 nodes. Waiting for the user's core OK via wap-supervisor. Side finding: Shape.Circle(3), the spelling the shared-case refusal tells programs to write, is refused ('Circle takes a value for each of its fields: r'), and Circle(r: 3) gives 'the typing stage reads only kernel forms'.\n\ndup?: fix-shared (by score, 2026-11-26)\n\nuser OK 2026-11-26 (interviewer popup): lands at +5 net core (scope.wap, type_notation.wap); census SIZE_NODES 178537 -> 178672 granted\n\nland: case-name eac5dce3 (merged with main; test_hello, growth, modules/enum_page/matching 103 ✓ with test_matching_wanted's red from reds.txt, the census at 178855 = main's 178720 + 135; patches in /Volumes/Worktrees/c-type-names/data/patches). user 2026-11-26 via wap-interviewer: +5 net core, size +135; wap-supervisor: sound.\n\nFixed in [4a3b6733](https://github.com/pannous/wap/commit/4a3b673345f6738b0d2fae9c6bb325d0f8fe864d): merge case-name: a case word written as a type narrows the enum its module's scope sees, so a module's own radius(c: Circle) keeps taking its Shape when the program also uses another module whose enum has a Circle; wap's size ceiling follows by 135 nodes (+5 core in core/analyze/scope.wap and core/type_notation.wap, census +135: user 2026-11-26 via wap-interviewer; wap-supervisor: sound at eac5dce3)",
